:"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数           | 作用                                        |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `--no-login` | 接 TDLib 但不走登录流程（已有 session 照样能用；CI / 容器用） |","table":"table-1"},"22":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-20","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数             | 作用                                                                    |\n| -------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--background` | 派生无终端的子进程，stdout/stderr 进 `logs/fuyubot.log`（每次新启动先清空旧日志），父进程等状态发布后返回 |","table":"table-1"},"23":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-21","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数               | 作用                                                                                                                                          |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--tui`（短写 `-t`） | 打开**终端操作面板**（顶部版本栏 + 导航/工作区 + 底部操作与资源占用），而不是前台跑 bot。面板自己不接 TDLib、不加载插件；`s` 派生 `run --background`，`x` 走优雅停止。与 `--background` / `--replay` 互斥 |","table":"table-1"},"24":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-22","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数              | 作用                                   |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `--replay <文件>` | 把一批更新 JSON 灌进管线后退出：**不接 TDLib、不用账号** |","table":"table-1"},"25":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-23","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数                   | 作用                                      |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `--replay-wait <MS>` | 回放后等插件的静默窗口；不填按插件形态自选（脚本插件 2000，原生 150） |","table":"table-1"},"26":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-24","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数                    | 作用                                                                  |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--log-level <LEVEL>` | 覆盖 `[plugins].log_level`（error / warn / info / debug / trace），不用改配置 |","table":"table-1"},"27":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-25","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数                    | 作用                                                          |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--log-plugin <NAME>` | 只看这些插件打出来的日志（可重复 / 逗号分隔；按 manifest 里的插件名，如 `fuyubot.start`） |","table":"table-1"},"28":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-26","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数                | 作用                                            |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `--trace-updates` | 把 TDLib 的每一条原始更新 / 响应打到 stderr（含消息内容，别在正式环境开） |","table":"table-1"},"29":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-27","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"`run` 不带 `--replay` 的顺序：自动 init → 把**工作目录切到项目根**（插件眼里的相对路径都从这里算）→ 拿单实例锁 → attach TDLib → 问/读凭据 → **加载全部插件** →\n发 `setTdlibParameters` 并登录 → `getMe` 打印账户 → 发布状态 → 才开始分发。\n**登录这一步没有真账号端到端验过**，要立刻验插件就用 `--replay`——想单独把登录走完（不起框架）用 `login`。"},"30":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-28","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"后台运行**没有 stdin**：没有 session 又没有 `TG_BOT_TOKEN` 时会直接失败并把日志尾巴打出来——\n先用前台登录一次（session 落在 `data/`）。"},"31":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-29","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"布局固定为四段：**顶部版本栏**（`[fuyubot - v…]`；实例运行中才显示状态，没跑时只显示刷新时间）、\n**左侧导航**（概览 / 插件 / 日志 / 配置 / 帮助）、**中央工作区**、**底部两行**\n（第一行是当前可用操作，第二行是 CPU / 内存 / 运行时长 / 加载插件数 / 日志级别 / PID）。\n顶部和底部**不铺背景色**，只靠边框高亮表示焦点。"},"32":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-30","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"> 底部的资源数字来自 `sysinfo`，采的是**运行中实例的 PID**（不是面板自己）；\n> 实例没跑时 CPU / 内存 / 运行 / PID 显示 `—`、插件数为 0，日志级别显示面板下次启动会用哪一档。\n> 启动后的第一个采样点 CPU 是 `0.0%`，下一秒才有真实值。"},"33":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-31","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"> 概览页「运行」区有三行是**从实例学来的**：TDLib 连接、TDLib 授权、账户。账户是登录后由\n> `getMe` 写进 `.fuyubot/status` 的（名字 + `@用户名`，宽屏再补 `id` 与 bot / user），\n> 之后 TDLib 用 `updateUser` 改名字 / 用户名时，实例把新值重发进 status，面板下一帧就跟着变。"},"34":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-32","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键                  | 作用                                                    |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Tab` / `Shift+Tab` | 在**导航**与**工作区**之间切换焦点（当前窗口边框高亮，底栏显示 `[导航]` / `[工作区]`） |","table":"table-2"},"35":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-33","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键              | 作用                                     |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `Enter` / `Esc` | 导航 → 工作区 / 工作区 → 导航（在导航上按 `Esc` 才退出面板） |","table":"table-2"},"36":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-34","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键                  | 作用                                    |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `↑` / `↓`、`j` / `k` | 导航焦点：切换页面；工作区焦点：滚动日志 / 选择配置项 / 移动日志选择 |","table":"table-2"},"37":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-35","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键        | 作用                       |\n| --------- | ------------------------ |\n| `←` / `→` | 切换顶部标签页（窄屏横向导航；工作区焦点也生效） |","table":"table-2"},"38":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-36","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键        | 作用             |\n| --------- | -------------- |\n| `h` / `l` | 导航焦点：上一页 / 下一页 |","table":"table-2"},"39":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-37","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键      | 作用                         |\n| ------- | -------------------------- |\n| `1`–`5` | 直接跳到概览 / 插件 / 日志 / 配置 / 帮助 |","table":"table-2"},"40":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-38","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键      | 作用                               |\n| ------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `Enter` | 日志页：进入日志选择模式；配置页：编辑选中的配置项（`e` 同） |","table":"table-2"},"41":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-39","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                                   |\n| --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `y` | 日志选择模式：复制选中行（TDLib Update 复制完整 JSON） |","table":"table-2"},"42":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-40","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                                     |\n| --- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `s` | 启动 bot（等价于 `fuyubot run --background`） |","table":"table-2"},"43":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-41","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键      | 作用                                                                                                      |\n| ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `L`（大写） | **登录**（等价于 `fuyubot login`）：按授权状态弹输入框（bot token / 手机号 / 验证码 / 两步验证密码），`Enter` 提交、`Esc` 取消。只在**实例停着**时可用 |","table":"table-2"},"44":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-42","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键        | 作用                                           |\n| --------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `x` → `y` | 停止 bot（`y` 是确认框里的确认；走 `.fuyubot/stop` 的优雅停止） |","table":"table-2"},"45":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-43","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                  |\n| --- | ------------------- |\n| `r` | 刷新状态 / 插件 / 日志 / 配置 |","table":"table-2"},"46":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-44","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                                                      |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `l` | 日志页 + 工作区焦点：调整日志级别（error / warn / info / debug / trace） |","table":"table-2"},"47":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-45","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                       |\n| --- | ------------------------ |\n| `F` | 日志页 + 工作区焦点：按级别 / 来源过滤日志 |","table":"table-2"},"48":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-46","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                        |\n| --- | ------------------------- |\n| `c` | 日志页 + 工作区焦点：清空当前日志文件（要确认） |","table":"table-2"},"49":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-47","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                 |\n| --- | ------------------ |\n| `f` | 日志页 + 工作区焦点：跟随末尾开关 |","table":"table-2"},"50":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-48","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键                             | 作用                            |\n| ------------------------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| `PgUp` / `PgDn`、`Home` / `End` | 工作区焦点：日志 / 帮助翻页、首尾；配置页选择翻页、首尾 |","table":"table-2"},"51":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-49","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键           | 作用                   |\n| ------------ | -------------------- |\n| `q`、`Ctrl+C` | 退出面板（**不会**停掉已启动的实例） |","table":"table-2"},"52":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-50","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"面板**不占实例锁、不加载插件、不接 TDLib**：同一个 TDLib 数据目录同一时刻只能一个进程打开，\n所以它只读 `.fuyubot/status`、配置、插件目录和 `logs/fuyubot.log`。启停都派生子进程，\n和手敲命令走同一条路——面板里看到的就是真正在跑的那个实例。"},"53":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-51","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"唯一的例外是**登录**（`L`）：它在面板进程里跑一次和 `fuyubot login` 完全相同的流程\n（同一份 `fuyubot-app` 的 `App::boot` + `login`），把授权状态机的提问弹成输入框，结束后\n立刻关掉 TDLib 交还目录。因此："},"54":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-52","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"**只在实例停着时可用**——跑着的时候按 `L` 只会提示你先停止；"},"55":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-53","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"`api_id` / `api_hash` 要事先在环境变量（`TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH`）或 `fuyubot.toml` 里准备好，\n面板不会再问这两项（那是 `fuyubot login` 的事）；"},"56":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-54","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"密码框会打码，验证码不打码；`Esc` 取消等同于这一步没给输入，登录会失败并退回待命状态；"},"57":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-55","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"登完之后 session 落在 `data/`，启动实例会直接进 `authorizationStateReady`。"},"58":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-56","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"日志页按 `l` 打开级别选择框：写入 `.fuyubot/log-level`，运行中的实例每 500ms 读一次并切换，\n`status` 随后显示新的 `log_level`。这是**运行期**开关：只对本次运行生效，重启回到\n`[plugins].log_level`（新实例拿锁时会清掉控制文件）。"},"59":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-57","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"`F` 打开过滤弹框：`↑↓` 选「级别 / 来源」，`←→` 改值，`c` 重置，`Enter` 应用。\n级别是下限（`info+` = error / warn / info）；来源分插件 / 宿主 / 管道 / 更新 / TDLib / 其他。\n新日志格式按「插件行 / source 词」归类（旧四列也兼容）：`TDLib Update` 追踪归**更新**（级别 trace），\nTDLib C 库的 `[ N][t …]` 原样行归 **TDLib**；认不出级别的启动提示按 info 对待。\n日志页底栏会显示 `x/y 行`。日志字段不按固定列补空格，长行会按**显示宽度**折行\n（续行缩进两格），不会直接截掉后半段。"},"60":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-58","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"TDLib Update 行在 TUI 里**只显示 `@type`**（例如 `TDLib Update  updateNewMessage`），\n不再把整段 JSON 铺在屏幕上。按 `Enter` 进入选择模式：`↑↓` 选行，`y` 或 `Enter`\n把选中行复制到系统剪贴板；TDLib Update 复制的是**完整 JSON**（不含时间戳等前缀），\n其它行复制整行。`Esc` 退出选择模式。"},"61":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-59","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"每次新启动后台实例都会先截断 `logs/fuyubot.log`（旧日志不保留）；日志页按 `c`\n可以手动清空当前日志文件，确认后清空并回到跟随末尾，运行中的实例会继续写新行。"},"62":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-60","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"窄终端（手机 / Termux）会自适应：宽度不足 90 列时左侧导航收窄，低于 60 列时导航\n移到工作区上方、变成一行横向标签，用 `←` / `→`（工作区焦点也生效）或 `h` / `l`\n（导航焦点）切换；更窄时标签退化成单字。底栏资源在窄屏只留 `CPU / 内存 / 级别`，\n不显示运行时长、插件数量和 PID；配置项在窄屏改成「完整键 + 值」两行；帮助页可用\n`↑↓` / `PgUp` / `PgDn` 滚动；概览里的绝对路径改成相对项目根的路径。日志在窄屏只留\n`HH:MM:SS`、插件名最后一段和级别，消息照常折行。复制优先用\n`termux-clipboard-set`（需装 `termux-api`），否则退回 OSC 52。"},"63":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-61","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#终端操作面板--tui","content":"配置页是**可编辑的表格**（段 / 键 / 生效值 / 来源），`↑↓` 选中、`Enter` 或 `e` 编辑。\n文本、整数（带上下界）和枚举（`account_type` / `log_level`）会先校验再写回；写回是\n**单行文本替换**，保留文件里的注释、顺序和 CRLF，键/段不存在就补。运行中保存的配置\n**重启后生效**；`api_hash`、Bot Token / 手机号 / 密码和 `[plugin.*]` 段只读（插件段请用\n插件自己的命令或直接编辑文件）。配置文件读不出来时配置页会显示错误原文，改好按 `r` 重读。"},"64":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-62","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#login","content":"**只登录，不起框架**：建 TDLib 客户端 → 走完授权 → 打印账户 → 退出。**不加载插件、不开接收循环**。\nsession 落在 `data/`，之后 `fuyubot run`（含 `--background`）起来就直接进 `Ready`——后台跑没有 stdin、\n登录问不了，先前台 `login` 一次正是给这条路准备的。"},"65":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-63","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#login","content":"| 参数         | 作用                                    |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `--config` | 配置文件，默认 `fuyubot.toml`（缺文件时同样会自动生成一份） |","table":"table-3"},"66":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-64","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#login","content":"| 参数              | 作用                                                               |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--api-id <ID>` | 与 `run` 的 `--api-id` 同义、同优先级（`--api-id` → `TG_API_ID` → 配置 → 提问） |","table":"table-3"},"67":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-65","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#login","content":"凭据解析、授权状态机、账户打印全部复用 `run` 的那套，两条路不会漂移。两条额外限制："},"68":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-66","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#login","content":"**实例在跑时拒绝**：TDLib 的 sqlite + binlog 同一时刻只能一个进程打开，`login` 再开一次会把跑着的实例拆坏。"},"69":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-67","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#login","content":"**TDLib 没就绪就报错退出**，告诉你缺什么（`TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH` / exe 同级 tdjson / `[tdlib].path`）。"},"70":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-68","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#logout","content":"清掉本地 TDLib 会话目录（= `[telegram].data_dir`，默认 `<项目根>/data`，里面是数据库与 binlog）＝ 退出登录，\n下次要重新登录。**默认只打印将要删除什么**，加 `--yes` 才真删。"},"71":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-69","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#logout","content":"它**只清本地**：不发服务端的 `logOut`（Telegram 那边的会话还在，只是本机这份没了）。"},"72":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-70","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#logout","content":"| 参数      | 作用                  |\n| ------- | ------------------- |\n| `--yes` | 真的删除。不加就是预览，一个文件都不动 |","table":"table-4"},"73":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-71","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#logout","content":"三道守卫与 `--yes` 无关，命中就拒绝："},"74":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-72","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#logout","content":"| 守卫   | 行为                               |\n| ---- | -------------------------------- |\n| 实例在跑 | 拒绝（预览前、真删前各挡一次）：运行中动会话目录会拆坏它的数据库 |","table":"table-5"},"75":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-73","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#logout","content":"| 守卫       | 行为                                       |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 目录不在项目根内 | 放行但打醒目警告：`data_dir` 指到项目外了，确认过再加 `--yes` |","table":"table-5"},"76":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-74","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#logout","content":"| 守卫                | 行为                                            |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| 目录里没有 `td.binlog` | 拒绝：那多半不是 TDLib 的数据目录（`data_dir` 指错了），要删请自己手工删 |","table":"table-5"},"77":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-75","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#status--stop","content":"`status` 只读 `<项目根>/.fuyubot/`，三态：运行中 / 启动中 / 没有运行中的实例（顺带报「上次」的 pid）。\n接上 TDLib 之后还会多出「连接」「授权」两行，登录成功再补一行「账户」\n（`名字 @用户名（id=…） [bot]`）——账户跟着 `updateUser` 刷新，不是登录那一刻的死快照。\n`stop` 是**优雅**的：写 `.fuyubot/stop` 请实例自己收摊（停接收循环 → 卸载插件 → 停内核 → 放锁），\n8 秒不理会才硬杀。"},"78":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-76","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"打印**生效值**：默认值填好之后每一项到底是什么，外加「向上找到的那份 `fuyubot.toml`」。\n不加载插件、不接 TDLib、不建任何东西。"},"79":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-77","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"文件不存在时第一行会写「（不存在，下面全是默认值）」——`run` 就是这样起的，不骗人。"},"80":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-78","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"`account_type` 写错**不会**静默当 bot：那一行直接是 `⚠️ [telegram].account_type = \"robot\" 认不出来，只能写 \"bot\" 或 \"user\"`。"},"81":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-79","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"每个 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 段各占一行（插件名是点分的，所以显示成 `[plugin.fuyubot.manage]`）；没有插件段时写「无（没有 `[plugin.*]` 段）」。"},"82":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-80","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"没有 `get` / `set` / `path`：改配置用编辑器更直接，路径 `status` 第一行已经打了。**插件**读写配置走 ABI 的 `get_config` / `set_config`（见插件 ABI），不是这个子命令。"},"83":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-81","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"| 命令                                                     | 作用                    |\n| ------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin list [--config …] [--plugin-dir <目录>]` | 列出插件；脚本插件会**展平到每个脚本** |","table":"table-6"},"84":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-82","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"| 命令                                                                | 作用                              |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin install <文件或目录> [--config …] [--plugin-dir <目录>]` | 装一个插件：传**目录**是脚本插件，传**文件**是原生插件 |","table":"table-6"},"85":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-83","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"| 命令                                                               | 作用                        |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin uninstall <名字> [--config …] [--plugin-dir <目录>]` | 卸载：脚本插件按**目录名**，原生插件按动态库名 |","table":"table-6"},"86":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-84","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"| 命令                                                                    | 作用                                       |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin migrate [--dry-run] [--config …] [--plugin-dir <目录>]` | 把旧形态平铺 dll / 老脚本目录迁成插件包（补 `plugin.json`） |","table":"table-6"},"87":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-85","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"**脚本插件**（见 脚本插件）：传的是**整个目录**\n（里面有 `pyproject.toml` / `package.json` 身份段），装到 `plugins/scripts/<目录名>/`。\n目标已存在会报错，要覆盖先 `uninstall` 再 `install`。"},"88":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-86","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"**原生插件**：传编好的 `.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib`，或**工程目录**。传目录时按\n`<工程>/target/{release,debug}` → 工程目录本身 → **沿父链最近的** `target/{release,debug}`\n这个顺序找产物（两边都有时取**较新**的那个）。最后一档就是给 workspace 成员准备的\n（`cargo build -p <crate>` 的产物落在仓库根 `target/`，工程自己那份 `target/` 根本不存在），\n所以那种情况**直接传工程目录就行**，没有 `--target-dir` 这个参数。"},"89":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-87","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"`list` 是**纯静态**的：原生插件读插件包根上的 `plugin.json`（不 dlopen），脚本插件按\n`plugins/scripts/<目录>/` 的清单列——不装依赖、不起进程，随时可以跑。"},"90":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-88","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"`uninstall` 对**跑着的实例也安全**：文件删掉后目录 watch 会自动卸载对应脚本，\n不需要先 `stop`。"},"91":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-89","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"脚本插件上手：脚本插件"},"92":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-90","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"配置字段：配置文件"},"93":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-91","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"实例与后台运行：运行与实例管理"},"94":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-92","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"回放的输出与等待窗口：离线回放"},"95":{"id":"/docs/cli","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"page","content":"CLI 总览","breadcrumbs":["Docs","CLI 文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli"},"96":{"id":"/docs/cli-0","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"fuyubot 的命令、共同约定与速查"},"97":{"id":"/docs/cli-1","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"共同约定"},"98":{"id":"/docs/cli-2","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#命令速查","content":"命令速查"},"99":{"id":"/docs/cli-3","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"`fuyubot` 是运行时唯一的命令行程序：跑框架、管实例、装卸插件。它**不编译、也不打包插件**——\n编译归插件作者自己的工具链（`cargo build`、`cl /LD`、`gcc -shared`）。"},"100":{"id":"/docs/cli-4","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"| CLI       | 干什么                                                                               | 二进制             |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------- |\n| `fuyubot` | 跑框架：`init` / `run` / `login` / `logout` / `status` / `stop` / `config` / `plugin` | `fuyubot(.exe)` |","table":"table-0"},"101":{"id":"/docs/cli-5","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"它就在运行时发行包里（旁边带着 `tdjson` 和内置插件目录 `plugins/`）。从源码跑的等价写法是把子命令接在 `--` 之后："},"102":{"id":"/docs/cli-6","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项               | 约定                                                                   |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--config <文件>` | 默认 `fuyubot.toml`；项目根 = 配置文件所在目录，`plugins/`、`data/`、`.fuyubot/` 都相对它 |","table":"table-1"},"103":{"id":"/docs/cli-7","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项                   | 约定                     |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `--plugin-dir <目录>` | 覆盖配置里的 `[plugins].dir` |","table":"table-1"},"104":{"id":"/docs/cli-8","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项   | 约定           |\n| --- | ------------ |\n| 退出码 | `0` 成功；非零是失败 |","table":"table-1"},"105":{"id":"/docs/cli-9","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项   | 约定                                                                           |\n| --- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 凭据  | **只走环境变量或交互式输入**，任何命令都不把它们写进文件（`TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH` / `TG_BOT_TOKEN`） |","table":"table-1"},"106":{"id":"/docs/cli-10","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项    | 约定                                             |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 输出语言 | 中文；`status` / `stop` 是给人看的，不要拿去解析（没有 `--json`） |","table":"table-1"},"107":{"id":"/docs/cli-11","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#命令速查","content":"<Card title=\"fuyubot 命令参考\" href=\"/docs/cli/fuyubot/\" />"},"108":{"id":"/docs/cli-12","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#命令速查","content":"<Card title=\"插件开发（怎么写插件）\" href=\"/docs/plugin/\" />"},"109":{"id":"/docs/dev/android","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","type":"page","content":"Android：JNI 运行时","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/android"},"110":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android","content":"只交付 libfuyubotjni.so —— 把整个宿主塞进 APK，而不是在手机上跑可执行文件"},"111":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/android#装法","content":"装法"},"112":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/android#启动","content":"启动"},"113":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/android#options-json","content":"options JSON"},"114":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/android#回调","content":"回调"},"115":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/android#停车","content":"停车"},"116":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/android#谁负责保活","content":"谁负责保活"},"117":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v2","content":"插件与 TDLib（ABI v2）"},"118":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/android#c-符号逃生门","content":"C 符号（逃生门）"},"119":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/android#与命令行的关系","content":"与命令行的关系"},"120":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android","content":"Android 上**交付的是一个 JNI 库**，不是 APK、不是可执行文件："},"121":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android","content":"APK 由应用作者自己出；这个包只提供**运行时本体**。宿主内部与桌面版是同一套东西\n（`fuyubot-app` 编排 + `fuyubot-loader` 宿主 + `fuyubot-tdlib`），只有「谁来回答登录提问」\n不同：Android 上是 Java 回调。"},"122":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#装法","content":"两个 `.so` 放进 `app/src/main/jniLibs/<abi>/`；"},"123":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#装法","content":"`plugins/` 里的 `.so`（可选）拷进你的 `<root>/plugins/`，并 `chmod 0444`\n（动态加载的代码要是只读的，Android 14 起对 `targetSdk 34+` 有这个要求）；"},"124":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#装法","content":"代码里**先加载 tdjson，再加载 fuyubotjni**。"},"125":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#装法","content":"> **绑定是运行期的**：`JNI_OnLoad` 用 `RegisterNatives` 把上面十个方法绑到\n> `com.catmoecircle.fuyubot.runtime.Native`（默认值），导出符号里没有 `Java_...`。\n> 类名 / 方法名 / 签名必须与上面一字不差；包名不是符号名的一部分——自己编译时可以用\n> `FUYUBOT_JNI_CLASS=com/你的/包/Native` 换掉，预编译包就按默认包名写。\n> `nativeRegister` 在 JNI 层收的是 `Object`，所以回调对象没有包名限制：库按方法名调\n> `onState` / `onAsk` / `onQr`，你自己的 interface 或 class 只要有这三个方法即可。\n>\n> 开了 R8 / ProGuard 必须 keep 绑定类，否则混淆改掉类名/方法名就绑不上（第一次调用才报\n> `UnsatisfiedLinkError`）：`-keep class com.catmoecircle.fuyubot.runtime.Native { *; }`"},"126":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#启动","content":"`nativeStart` **立即返回**：真正干活在库内的工作线程上。成功只代表「线程起来了」，\n不代表已登录——进度看 `onState` 与 `<root>/logs/fuyubot.log`。"},"127":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#options-json","content":"| 字段     | 必填  | 说明                                                                 |\n| ------ | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `root` | ✅   | 绝对路径，**必须是 app 私有目录**（`filesDir`）。`/sdcard` 是 `noexec`，TDLib 也写不进去 |","table":"table-0"},"128":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#options-json","content":"| 字段       | 必填  | 说明                              |\n| -------- | --- | ------------------------------- |\n| `api_id` | ✅   | int32，与 `setTdlibParameters` 一致 |","table":"table-0"},"129":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#options-json","content":"| 字段         | 必填  | 说明                      |\n| ---------- | --- | ----------------------- |\n| `api_hash` | ✅   | 只用于登录，**不会**进配置树（插件读不到） |","table":"table-0"},"130":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#options-json","content":"| 字段          | 必填  | 说明                    |\n| ----------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `bot_token` |     | 有值就走 bot 登录，全程不弹任何 UI |","table":"table-0"},"131":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#options-json","content":"| 字段           | 必填  | 说明                     |\n| ------------ | --- | ---------------------- |\n| `plugin_dir` |     | 相对 `root`，默认 `plugins` |","table":"table-0"},"132":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-22","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#options-json","content":"| 字段         | 必填  | 说明                                    |\n| ---------- | --- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `data_dir` |     | 相对 `root`，默认 `data`（TDLib 数据库与文件都在这儿） |","table":"table-0"},"133":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-23","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#options-json","content":"| 字段          | 必填  | 说明                                                      |\n| ----------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `log_level` |     | `error` / `warn` / `info` / `debug` / `trace`，默认 `info` |","table":"table-0"},"134":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-24","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#options-json","content":"| 字段                    | 必填  | 说明                  |\n| --------------------- | --- | ------------------- |\n| `tdlib_log_verbosity` |     | TDLib 自己的日志详细度，默认 1 |","table":"table-0"},"135":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-25","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#options-json","content":"| 字段        | 必填  | 说明                               |\n| --------- | --- | -------------------------------- |\n| `lib_dir` |     | 显式指定 `libtdjson.so` 所在的目录（一般不用给） |","table":"table-0"},"136":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-26","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#options-json","content":"目录会在启动时自动建好：`<root>/{data,logs,plugins}`。日志写在 `<root>/logs/fuyubot.log`——\nAndroid 应用进程的 stdout/stderr 是 `/dev/null`，所以这是**唯一**能看到日志的地方。"},"137":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-27","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#回调","content":"`state`："},"138":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-28","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#回调","content":"| 值            | 含义             |\n| ------------ | -------------- |\n| `0` STARTING | 起来了，正在装插件 / 登录 |","table":"table-1"},"139":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-29","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#回调","content":"| 值         | 含义         |\n| --------- | ---------- |\n| `1` READY | 已登录，开始分发更新 |","table":"table-1"},"140":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-30","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#回调","content":"| 值            | 含义          |\n| ------------ | ----------- |\n| `2` STOPPING | 收到停止请求，正在收摊 |","table":"table-1"},"141":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-31","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#回调","content":"| 值           | 含义   |\n| ----------- | ---- |\n| `3` STOPPED | 收摊完成 |","table":"table-1"},"142":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-32","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#回调","content":"| 值          | 含义                |\n| ---------- | ----------------- |\n| `4` FAILED | 出事退出，`detail` 是原因 |","table":"table-1"},"143":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-33","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#回调","content":"`kind`（`prompt` 一律是给人看的中文整句，直接显示即可）："},"144":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-34","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#回调","content":"| 值   | 含义        | 建议的输入框                   |\n| --- | --------- | ------------------------ |\n| `0` | bot token | 文本（有 `bot_token` 时根本不会问） |","table":"table-2"},"145":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-35","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#回调","content":"| 值   | 含义  | 建议的输入框    |\n| --- | --- | --------- |\n| `1` | 手机号 | 文本 + 数字键盘 |","table":"table-2"},"146":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-36","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#回调","content":"| 值   | 含义  | 建议的输入框              |\n| --- | --- | ------------------- |\n| `2` | 验证码 | 数字（长度写在 `prompt` 里） |","table":"table-2"},"147":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-37","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#回调","content":"| 值   | 含义     | 建议的输入框      |\n| --- | ------ | ----------- |\n| `3` | 两步验证密码 | **密码框**（打码） |","table":"table-2"},"148":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-38","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#回调","content":"| 值   | 含义   | 建议的输入框                |\n| --- | ---- | --------------------- |\n| `4` | 登录方式 | 二选一：回答 `phone` 或 `qr` |","table":"table-2"},"149":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-39","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#回调","content":"| 值   | 含义  | 建议的输入框 |\n| --- | --- | ------ |\n| `5` | 其它  | 通用文本框  |","table":"table-2"},"150":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-40","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#回调","content":"回调发生在**库的工作线程**上（不是 Java 主线程），弹窗 / 通知请自己切线程；回调里别做长耗时操作\n——它挡着登录状态机。`nativeAnswer(id, null)` 表示取消，登录会以失败收场。"},"151":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-41","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#回调","content":"`onQr` 对应 TDLib 的「其它设备确认」登录：把链接显示出来（或自己画二维码）即可，不需要回答。"},"152":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-42","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#停车","content":"`nativeStop` 是幂等的：没在跑就返回 `0`。**必须调**——库的工作线程与 tokio 运行时不是\ndaemon，不调会把进程吊在那儿。"},"153":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-43","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#谁负责保活","content":"**库不声明任何 Android 组件、权限或唤醒锁**，也不做自启 / 互拉。这些只能在应用侧做："},"154":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-44","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#谁负责保活","content":"| 事项                                      | 谁做  |\n| --------------------------------------- | --- |\n| 前台 Service、通知渠道、`foregroundServiceType` | 应用  |","table":"table-3"},"155":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-45","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#谁负责保活","content":"| 事项                          | 谁做  |\n| --------------------------- | --- |\n| `PARTIAL_WAKE_LOCK`、电池优化白名单 | 应用  |","table":"table-3"},"156":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-46","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#谁负责保活","content":"| 事项                                  | 谁做  |\n| ----------------------------------- | --- |\n| 被杀后重启（`START_STICKY` / WorkManager） | 应用  |","table":"table-3"},"157":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-47","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#谁负责保活","content":"| 事项     | 谁做                                         |\n| ------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 网络断线重连 | 库（TDLib 内建，经 `updateConnectionState` 转给插件） |","table":"table-3"},"158":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-48","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#谁负责保活","content":"| 事项               | 谁做                              |\n| ---------------- | -----------------------------