_version` | 插件编进去的 ABI 版本 |","table":"table-4"},"167":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-57","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v2","content":"| 字段      | 说明                                                         |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `state` | `active` / `pending` / `activating` / `failed` / `unknown` |","table":"table-4"},"168":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-58","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v2","content":"| 字段                       | 说明                         |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| `inject` / `soft_inject` | 硬 / 软依赖（manifest 优先，配置段兜底） |","table":"table-4"},"169":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-59","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v2","content":"| 字段              | 说明       |\n| --------------- | -------- |\n| `path` / `file` | 插件文件与文件名 |","table":"table-4"},"170":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-60","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v2","content":"| 字段                   | 说明                                                    |\n| -------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `missing` / `reason` | 仅 `pending` 有 `missing`（还缺哪些能力），仅 `failed` 有 `reason` |","table":"table-4"},"171":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-61","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v2","content":"状态是**现算**的（内核的插件报告），不是装插件那一刻的快照；运行时没起来时\n`nativePlugins()` 返回 `{\"count\":0,\"plugins\":[]}`（不是 `null`，也不是错误）。"},"172":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-62","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v2","content":"`nativeTdRequest` 的规矩："},"173":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-63","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v2","content":"发出去的是**原始 td_api JSON**，响应原样回来：`{\"@type\":\"user\",…}`；\nTDLib 的业务错误也是**正常响应**（`{\"@type\":\"error\",\"code\":…,\"message\":…}`），不是 `null`。"},"174":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-64","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v2","content":"`null` 只表示**没拿到响应**：运行时没起来、JSON 非法、发不出去、超时。原因读\n`nativeLastError()`（**线程局部**：要在同一个线程上紧接着读）。"},"175":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-65","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v2","content":"`timeoutMs <= 0` → 默认 30 秒，上限 600 秒。"},"176":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-66","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v2","content":"**阻塞**：放到 `Dispatchers.IO` 之类的线程上。"},"177":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-67","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#插件与-tdlibabi-v2","content":"⚠️ 别在 `onState` / `onAsk` 回调里调它：那些回调就跑在库的工作线程上，等响应等于\n自己等自己——库会认出这条线程并立刻返回 `null`。"},"178":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-68","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#c-符号逃生门","content":"不走 JNI 也能直接用这 9 个 C 符号（头文件在包里）："},"179":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-69","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#c-符号逃生门","content":"返回码：`0` 成功、`1` 参数错、`2` 已在运行、`3` 超时、`4` 内部 panic（已兜住）、`5` 内部错\n（细节看 `fuyubot_last_error()`）。三个返回字符串的函数同一套纪律：**线程局部缓冲**，\n下次在同一线程调本库前有效，别 free、别存、别跨线程传。\n纯 C 宿主没有回调通道：`onAsk` 那一步没人回答，所以只适合 `bot_token` 登录（把它放进 options）。"},"180":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-70","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#与命令行的关系","content":"同一个 bot 两种跑法，session 互相通用："},"181":{"id":"/docs/dev/android-71","page_id":"/docs/dev/android","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/android#与命令行的关系","content":"两者都走 `fuyubot-app` 的同一套顺序（装插件 → 登录 → 分发 → 收摊），区别只在宿主：\n一个把提问打到控制台，一个抛成 Java 回调；`data/` 里的 TDLib session 两边是同一份格式。"},"182":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"page","content":"架构与数据流