uginjson","content":"脚本插件的 `plugin.json` 可以只写身份，`entry` 指向脚本："},"813":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"发布时打一个 zip，**zip 根就是插件目录的内容**，不要套一层目录："},"814":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"打包要求："},"815":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"只放运行需要的东西：不要带 `node_modules/`、`.venv/`、`target/`、`.git/`；"},"816":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"不要放符号链接；"},"817":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"单个 zip 不超过 50MB，解压后不超过 200MB，文件数不超过 2000；"},"818":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"文件名不要以点或空格结尾，不要用 `CON`、`NUL`、`COM1` 这类 Windows 保留名\n（大小写也算冲突）；"},"819":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"资产名建议 `<id>-<version>-<平台>.zip`，例如\n`com.example.weather-1.2.0-windows-x86_64.zip`；纯脚本包用 `-any.zip`。\nAndroid 用 `android-aarch64` / `android-x86_64`，入口是 `.so`（例如\n`bin/libweather.so`），不能拿 Linux 的包代替。"},"820":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"商城按资产名和 `plugin.json` 校验，不符合上面的规则会被拒绝收录。"},"821":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#从商店安装","content":"新建项目默认已配置官方商店（`fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugins].registry_url`）。\n换商店改那一行，删掉则关闭商店。"},"822":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#从商店安装","content":"运行 `fuyubot run --tui`，进「商店」页搜索、选中、安装，然后重启实例。"},"823":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#本地目录安装","content":"原生包装进 `plugins/<id>/`，脚本包装进 `plugins/scripts/<目录名>/`。\n也可以用 `fuyubot plugin install` 装单个 `.dll`（旧形态），但推荐目录包。"},"824":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#手动安装","content":"把 zip 解压到 `plugins/<id>/`，或者把目录直接拷进去，然后重启："},"825":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象                | 原因 / 处理                                       |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin list` 看不到 | 目录不在 `plugins/` 下，或 `plugin.json` 读不了；确认路径与权限 |","table":"table-1"},"826":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象             | 原因 / 处理                                       |\n| -------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| 提示 `id` 与目录不一致 | 目录名和 `plugin.json` 的 `id` 不同会以 `id` 为准；改名保持一致 |","table":"table-1"},"827":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象      | 原因 / 处理              |\n| ------- | -------------------- |\n| 提示平台不匹配 | 压缩包不是给当前系统的；换对应平台的资产 |","table":"table-1"},"828":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象      | 原因 / 处理                       |\n| ------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 提示入口不存在 | `entry` 写错，或打包时漏了 `bin/` 里的文件 |","table":"table-1"},"829":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象           | 原因 / 处理                                       |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------------- |\n| 启动时报 ABI 不匹配 | 插件编译时的 ABI 与宿主不一致；用与宿主同版本的 `fuyubot-abi` 重新编译 |","table":"table-1"},"830":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象       | 原因 / 处理                                      |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 加载后名字对不上 | `plugin_init` 返回的名字必须等于 `plugin.json` 的 `id` |","table":"table-1"},"831":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#卸载","content":"只删插件目录，`[plugin.<id>]` 配置和 `data/plugins/<id>/` 不会被删。"},"832":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"page","content":"订阅与事件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events"},"833":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events","content":"on/off/emit、过滤器、双通道与归属"},"834":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"双通道：具体 `@type` 与兜底 `update`"},"835":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"过滤器"},"836":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"归属：`emit` 不是广播"},"837":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#rust","content":"Rust"},"838":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#脚本插件","content":"脚本插件"},"839":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events","content":"事件总线是插件拿到 TDLib 更新的唯一入口，也是插件之间说话的方式。三个动作：\n`on` 订阅（返回句柄）、`off` 退订（或让句柄 drop）、`emit` 发自定义事件。"},"840":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"每条更新会被**同时**发到两条通道上："},"841":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"| 通道                                | 谁收         | 什么时候用    |\n| --------------------------------- | ---------- | -------- |\n| 具体的 `@type`（`updateNewMessage` 等） | 精确订阅了它的监听器 | 你只关心一种更新 |","table":"table-0"},"842":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"| 通道         | 谁收           | 什么时候用                 |\n| ---------- | ------------ | --------------------- |\n| `\"update\"` | 订阅兜底通道的所有监听器 | 你要看全部，或不想追 TDLib 的类型名 |","table":"table-0"},"843":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"| 通道           | 谁收               | 什么时候用              |\n| ------------ | ---------------- | ------------------ |\n| `\"response\"` | **只发给发起那个请求的插件** | 收 `td_invoke*` 的结果 |","table":"table-0"},"844":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"`\"update\"` 与 `\"response\"` 是 ABI 常量（`UPDATE_EVENT` / `RESPONSE_EVENT`），别自己拼字符串。"},"845":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"一条更新从进来到落到你的回调，中间是这样走的："},"846":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"更新分发：穿过管线后同时发到两条通道"},"847":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"TDLib 的更新经接收循环交给 UpdatePipeline，穿过 PreUpdate、PreRoute、InPlugin、PostResponse 四个阶段后，被同时发到具体 @type 通道与兜底 update 通道，分别落到精确订阅的插件与订阅兜底的插件。"},"848":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"TdClient 接收循环"},"849":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"一条原始 JSON 更新进来"},"850":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"UpdatePipeline::process_value"},"851":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"六阶段，实跑 4 个"},"852":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"PreUpdate"},"853":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"0 · 刚进来"},"854":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"PreRoute"},"855":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"1 · 解析 @type"},"856":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"InPlugin"},"857":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"2 · 可改负载"},"858":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"PostResponse"},"859":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"3 · 收尾"},"860":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"中间件挂在阶段上；一条更新只跑一遍，不是每个监听器一遍"},"861":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"同时发两条"},"862":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"具体 @type 通道"},"863":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"updateNewMessage、……"},"864":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"兜底 update 通道"},"865":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"每条更新都发一份"},"866":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"插件 A"},"867":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"精确订阅 updateNewMessage"},"868":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"插件 B"},"869":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"订阅兜底 update，或带过滤器"},"870":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"**两条通道是「同时」，不是「二选一」**：一条 `updateNewMessage` 既会敲精确订阅它的监听器，也会敲所有\n订阅了 `\"update\"` 的监听器。过滤器在两个通道上各判一次，所以订阅兜底又写了过滤器的那一侧不会因为\n「没命中精确通道」而漏掉。"},"871":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"`on` 的第三个参数是一份过滤器 JSON：**点分路径 → 期望值**。"},"872":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则                       | 说明                                                                |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `event_type` 键只用来**选通道** | `{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":5}` 表示等 5 号响应；它**不参与负载匹配** |","table":"table-1"},"873":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则           | 说明                                                            |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 其余键做负载字段相等匹配 | 字段位置随更新类型变：`updateNewMessage` 的 `chat_id` 在 `message.chat_id` |","table":"table-1"},"874":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则              | 说明    |\n| --------------- | ----- |\n| 空 / `null` / 不传 | 该通道全收 |","table":"table-1"},"875":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"同一个事件可以订阅**多次**、各带各的过滤器。脚本侧按订阅号 `handle` 分发，所以不该响的回调不会响。"},"876":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"插件里调 `emit` 走的是 `emit_scoped(自己, …)`：只送给**该插件自己 + 全局订阅者**。\n归属的语义是「**额外定向**」而不是「排除广播」——宿主 `emit` 的更新照旧发给所有订阅者，\n`emit_scoped(owner, …)` 只是在那份收件人之外**再加**上 `owner` 自己的订阅。"},"877":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发             | 谁收得到     |\n| -------------- | -------- |\n| 宿主发更新 / `emit` | 所有匹配的订阅者 |","table":"table-2"},"878":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发                | 谁收得到              |\n| ----------------- | ----------------- |\n| 插件 `emit(\"x\", …)` | 该插件自己的订阅者 + 全局订阅者 |","table":"table-2"},"879":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发    | 谁收得到                                       |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 宿主的响应 | `emit_scoped(发起者, \"response\", …)`：全局 + 发起者 |","table":"table-2"},"880":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"要让别的插件收到你的事件，**让对方订阅全局事件**，不要指望你的 `emit` 是一次广播。"},"881":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"订阅句柄不会自动退订。`HostApi::on` 返回的是 `SubscriptionHandle`（一个 `u64`），\ndrop 它什么也不会发生；要提前退订就自己留住句柄并调 `host.off(handle)`。\n插件卸载时宿主会整批回滚。"},"882":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#rust","content":"回调用 `extern \"C-unwind\" fn(user_data, payload: *const c_char) -> i32`，返回 `0` 表示成功；\n`payload` 是宿主临时的 NUL 结尾字符串，要留就当场拷走（`serde_json::from_str` 解析）。"},"883":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#脚本插件","content":"脚本侧的事件模型与此完全相同（同样的通道、同样的点分过滤），只是入口换成了薄 SDK\n的 `on(event, handler, filter)`。那一套不在本板块：见脚本插件。"},"884":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#脚本插件","content":"要按固定次数等一条更新（阻塞式），用 `wait_for_update`，见 调用 TDLib。\n要改流经管线的负载，用中间件，见 工具与中间件。"},"885":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"page","content":"外部仓库插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external"},"886":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external","content":"不进本体 workspace 的原生插件，怎么接依赖、怎么拿插件目录"},"887":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#依赖只能走-path","content":"依赖：只能走 path"},"888":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#插件目录别自己算","content":"插件目录：别自己算"},"889":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#线程回调里不能做慢事","content":"线程：回调里不能做慢事"},"890":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#装与验","content":"装与验"},"891":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#一个真实例子","content":"一个真实例子"},"892":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#下一步","content":"下一步"},"893":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external","content":"内置插件（`/start`、`/help`、`/plugins`）跟着发布包走，**第三方插件不必**：\n它们自己一个仓库、`cargo build` 出一个 cdylib，用 `fuyubot plugin install` 装进项目。"},"894":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external","content":"形态和内置插件完全一样（同一个 `define_plugin!`、同一张 `HostApiVTable`），\n差别只在三件事：**依赖怎么接**、**插件目录在哪**、**运行时库能不能从 crates.io 拿**。"},"895":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#依赖只能走-path","content":"运行时仓库只往 crates.io 发两个 crate：`fuyubot-abi` 和 `fuyubot-tdlib-sys`。\n**`fuyubot-simplify` 是 `publish = false`**——它不在 crates.io 上。"},"896":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#依赖只能走-path","content":"把它写成 `fuyubot-simplify = \"0.1\"` 会**编不过**（crates.io 上没有这个版本）。\n等它发版之后换成一行版本号就行。"},"897":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#依赖只能走-path","content":"`fuyubot-simplify` 在这里只当「人话参数 → TDLib 请求体」的构造器库用：\n`SendMessageParams` / `Media` / `Text` / `send_params` / `album_params` / `edit_*_params`。\n「发出去并等结局」那一步走 ABI v5 的 op JSON 分发——\n和 Python / JS / Go 插件同一条路。"},"898":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#插件目录别自己算","content":"插件是宿主进程 `dlopen` 出来的动态库，`std::env::current_exe()` 拿到的是 **`fuyubot.exe`**，\n不是插件自己的目录——插件算不出自己旁边有什么文件。"},"899":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#插件目录别自己算","content":"要读同目录的静态资源（cookie、词表、模板），让宿主告诉你：\n`plugin_start` 的 `config_json` 里带着 `plugins_dir`（绝对路径）。"},"900":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#插件目录别自己算","content":"内置 `manage` 插件就是这么写的，可以照抄。"},"901":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#线程回调里不能做慢事","content":"`updateNewMessage` 的回调跑在**宿主的接收循环线程**上。解析网页、调外部 API、\n等 TDLib 应答——任何一件在这里同步做，都会把整个宿主堵死（同进程所有插件一起卡）。"},"902":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#线程回调里不能做慢事","content":"⚠️ 那个 `JoinHandle` **必须存进插件状态并在 `stop()` 里 join 掉**：\n宿主卸载动态库之后，线程还在跑库里的代码就是**未定义行为**。"},"903":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#装与验","content":"`--replay-wait` 给插件的静默窗口：要发慢速网络请求时调大，否则进程可能在请求发出前就退了\n（默认原生插件只有 150 ms）。见 离线回放。"},"904":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#一个真实例子","content":"FuyuBot-Douyin——抖音解析插件，\n`/dy <链接>` + 消息里自动识别抖音链接。它演示了本文全部三件事：\npath 依赖、靠 `plugins_dir` 读 cookie、回调里 spawn 工作线程。"},"905":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#一个真实例子","content":"同类做法另见 `XQAnimeBot-Rust`（把 MongoDB / qBittorrent / ffmpeg 各自拆成一个插件，\n业务插件按服务名取用）。"},"906":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"Rust 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rust/\" />"},"907":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"ABI 契约\" href=\"/docs/plugin/abi/\" />"},"908":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"离线回放\" href=\"/docs/usage/replay/\" />"},"909":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"page","content":"Go 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go"},"910":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"cgo 编 c-shared，逻辑用 Go 写、ABI 用一层 C 薄壳"},"911":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"结构：Go 写逻辑，C 写壳"},"912":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"常用 ABI 怎么调：在 `plugin.c` 里加桥"},"913":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage`（或者用 `simplify_invoke`）"},"914":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"编译"},"915":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"一个宿主行为要记住：Go 库不会被卸载"},"916":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#验证","content":"验证"},"917":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"相关"},"918":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"Go 也能写插件：`go build -buildmode=c-shared` 出来的就是标准动态库，宿主只要看到七个导出符号\n就认它。Go 这条路线没有脚手架——照本页的结构自己搭，ABI 头文件从 `fuyubot-abi` 落盘\n（见 C 与 C++ 插件）。"},"919":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"Go 没有脚手架模板，也没有官方的 `go-ping` 示例——照下面这几段自己搭工程。\nC 头文件仍然由 `fuyubot-abi` 生成，两门语言共用同一份，不要手抄。"},"920":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件        | 作用                               |\n| --------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `main.go` | 逻辑：解析更新 JSON、拼 `sendMessage`、打日志 |","table":"table-0"},"921":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件         | 作用                                                                              |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin.c` | 四个 ABI 符号：`plugin_init` / `plugin_start` / `plugin_stop` / `plugin_free_string` |","table":"table-0"},"922":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件                 | 作用                                                |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot_plugin.h` | 生成物（由 `fuyubot-abi` 的 `PLUGIN_HEADER` 落盘），**不提交** |","table":"table-0"},"923":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"为什么不直接 `//export plugin_init`：`PluginHandle` 是**按值返回**的结构体，由 C 侧构造最稳；\n也避免把宿主 VTable 的函数指针搬进 Go。C 侧只做转发："},"924":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"Go 侧通过两个 C 小桥访问宿主（这样 Go 里不用碰函数指针）："},"925":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"`fy_log` / `fy_invoke` 在 `plugin.c` 里实现，就是 `g_host->log` / `g_host->td_invoke_simplified` 的转发。"},"926":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"本页的 `plugin.c` 只带了两个桥（`fy_log` / `fy_invoke`）。要用别的 ABI 函数就照同样形状加——\n**每个桥一行转发**，Go 侧不碰函数指针："},"927":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"Go 侧声明 + 包一层："},"928":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"三条 cgo 侧的硬规则："},"929":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"传给 C 的字符串用 `C.CString` + `defer C.free`；漏了就是泄漏。"},"930":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"桥返回的 `const char *` 是**宿主缓冲**：`C.GoString` 立刻拷贝，**不要**把 `*C.char` 存下来，\n也**不要** free 它。"},"931":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"订阅句柄留在 C 侧（`plugin_start` 里 `g_host->on(...)` 存进静态变量），Go 侧不持有——\ndrop 即退订，交到 Go 手里容易漏。"},"932":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"> ✅ **ABI v5 起，这一节只是「另一条路」，不再是唯一的路。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑\n> 同一份 `fuyubot-simplify` 代码，经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张\n> **op 表**（`{\"op\":\"send_message\",\"args\":{…}}`），所有语言都能用——发消息等结局、超时撤回、\n> bot 与用户号挑不同反应方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树，都不用手写。\n> 见 ABI › simplify 操作表。\n> Go 没有脚手架（见页首），但可以直接调 VTable 上的\n> `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result`（见下），或者照下面手写 `invoke(sendMessage, …)`。"},"933":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"先来一个能跑的：在 `plugin.c` 里加一座 `simplify_invoke` 桥（和 `fy_invoke` 同形状），Go 侧就能像\n调普通函数一样发 op——宿主替你解析文本、等到真发出去、超时先撤回；结果经已有的 `\"response\"`\n通道回投（带 `request_id`，与 `fy_invoke` 的响应同一个 `on` 通道）："},"934":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `invoke(\"sendMessage\", …)` 是**另一条路**——下面这些字段你都得自己拼对："},"935":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                               |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 纯文本   | `input_message_content` = `inputMessageText`，`text` 是 `formattedText` |","table":"table-1"},"936":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果           | 手写的关键字段                                                                                  |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Markdown / HTML | 先 `fy_execute` 调 `parseTextEntities`（`version: 2` = MarkdownV2），把返回的 `formattedText` 塞进去 |","table":"table-1"},"937":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                 |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回复某条  | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\": \"inputMessageReplyToMessage\", \"message_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"938":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                            |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 发到话题  | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\": \"messageTopicForum\", \"forum_topic_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"939":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                     |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内联按钮  | `reply_markup` = `replyMarkupInlineKeyboard`；callback 的 `data` 是 **base64** |","table":"table-1"},"940":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果    | 手写的关键字段                                                      |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 等到「真发出去」 | 请求号只到**临时消息**；要最终 `Message` 得再等 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` |","table":"table-1"},"941":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"方法名与字段名以 `td_api.tl` 为准（见调用 TDLib）。"},"942":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"cgo 需要 C 编译器：Linux / macOS 用 `cc`，Windows 用 mingw-w64（如\nw64devkit）。"},"943":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"先把 `fuyubot_plugin.h` 落到工程里（见 C 与 C++ 插件 › 头文件），然后："},"944":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"Windows 上没装 mingw 时报 `gcc: executable file not found` 或\n`cannot open file 'mingwex.lib'`——那是缺 C 工具链，不是插件代码的问题。\nMSVC 的 `cl` 不能直接给 cgo 用（Go 的 Windows 外部链接器要 GCC 那一套）。"},"945":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"Go 的 `c-shared` 运行时有线程与信号处理器，`FreeLibrary` / `dlclose` 之后进程会直接\naccess violation（`0xC0000005`）。"},"946":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"所以 `fuyubot-loader` 会识别 Go 产物（文件里的 `\\xff Go buildinf:` 魔数），\n**故意不卸载**这类库：`plugin_stop` 照跑、注册照回滚，只是那几 MB 库内存留到进程退出。\n普通 Rust / C / C++ 插件不受影响，仍是 drop 即卸载。"},"947":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"这也意味着：**别在同一个进程里反复加载同一个 Go 插件**（热重载路径别指望它）。\n先 `fuyubot stop` 再 `run`，行为是干净的。"},"948":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#验证","content":"回放输出里应能看到 `go-ping 插件：回了 pong` 和一条\n`sendMessage {\"chat_id\":…,\"input_message_content\":{\"@type\":\"inputMessageText\",…}}`。"},"949":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"ABI 细节（2 个 u32 + `host_ctx` + 22 个函数指针、内存所有权、版本协商）：ABI 契约"},"950":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"C / C++ 的写法（同一份头文件）：C 与 C++ 插件"},"951":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"订阅与过滤器：订阅与事件"},"952":{"id":"/docs/plugin","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"page","content":"插件总览","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin"},"953":{"id":"/docs/plugin-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"一个 cdylib = 一个插件：七个导出符号、依赖声明与最小闭环"},"954":{"id":"/docs/plugin-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"原生插件：七个导出符号"},"955":{"id":"/docs/plugin-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"最小闭环（原生插件）"},"956":{"id":"/docs/plugin-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"写原生插件要知道的六件事"},"957":{"id":"/docs/plugin-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"声明依赖：`inject` 与 `soft_inject`"},"958":{"id":"/docs/plugin-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"按语言看"},"959":{"id":"/docs/plugin-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"按能力看"},"960":{"id":"/docs/plugin-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"插件名与目录"},"961":{"id":"/docs/plugin-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"本板块只讲**原生插件**：一个 cdylib（`.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib`）就是一个插件，\n用 Rust / C / C++ / Go 写，直接和宿主同进程跑 C ABI。"},"962":{"id":"/docs/plugin-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"**只想写脚本？** Python / JS / TS 不走这条路。脚本能力完全由独立的\n`fuyubot.script` 插件提供，见脚本插件：一个目录就是一个插件，\n不编译、不碰 ABI，装上就跑。"},"963":{"id":"/docs/plugin-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"一个原生插件 = 一个 cdylib。宿主 `dlopen` 它，只认这七个导出符号，\n其余全部能力都经 `HostApiVTable` 回调宿主。插件不认识 Rust 内核，也不需要认识。"},"964":{"id":"/docs/plugin-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗    | 干什么                                               |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_init` | **必须** | 校验 VTable、构造插件状态；返回失败句柄（`abi_version == 0`）= 拒绝加载 |","table":"table-0"},"965":{"id":"/docs/plugin-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号             | 必须吗 | 干什么                       |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | 可选  | 拿到配置 JSON，注册订阅 / 工具 / 中间件 |","table":"table-0"},"966":{"id":"/docs/plugin-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗 | 干什么            |\n| ------------- | --- | -------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | 可选  | 卸载前调一次，回收自己的状态 |","table":"table-0"},"967":{"id":"/docs/plugin-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗    | 干什么                               |\n| -------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | **必须** | 释放**插件自己**分配的字符串（宿主从不 free 插件的指针） |","table":"table-0"},"968":{"id":"/docs/plugin-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                | 必须吗   | 干什么                                                                              |\n| ----------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_manifest` | v4 可选 | 返回自描述 JSON（名字 / 版本 / `inject` / `soft_inject`）。宿主在 `plugin_init` **之前**读它来决定激活顺序 |","table":"table-0"},"969":{"id":"/docs/plugin-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                    | 必须吗   | 干什么                                  |\n| --------------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot_abi_version` | v4 可选 | 静态返回编译期 `ABI_VERSION`；静态检查工具不加载也能看到它 |","table":"table-0"},"970":{"id":"/docs/plugin-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗   | 干什么                                                         |\n| -------------------- | ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_handle` | v4 可选 | 只在 ABI 版本不匹配时被调——那一刻不能调 `plugin_stop`，只能用它把 `init` 分配的状态还回来 |","table":"table-0"},"971":{"id":"/docs/plugin-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"契约细节（字段布局、内存所有权、版本协商、服务作用域）见 ABI 契约。"},"972":{"id":"/docs/plugin-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"最小可跑的 Rust 插件全文见 Rust 插件；C / C++ / Go 见各自页面。"},"973":{"id":"/docs/plugin-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"`fuyubot init` 重复执行会被挡住（不覆盖你改过的配置）；三个键都有默认值，最简可以只有 `[bot]`。"},"974":{"id":"/docs/plugin-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"插件名只允许字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`（会拼进源码与 TOML）；目录名里的 `.` / `-` 换成 `_` 当 crate 名\n（`fuyubot.weather` → `fuyubot_weather`）。"},"975":{"id":"/docs/plugin-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"**产物落在哪**：`plugin install <工程目录>` 按 `<工程>/target/{release,debug}` → 工程目录本身 →\n**沿父链最近的** `target/{release,debug}` 找产物（两边都有时取较新的）。插件若是**当前 workspace 的成员**，\n`cargo build -p <crate>` 默认把产物放在仓库根的 `target/`，靠最后一档照样能找到，不需要额外参数。"},"976":{"id":"/docs/plugin-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"`fuyubot` 不编译、也不打包插件：编译是作者自己语言工具链的事\n（`cargo build` / `cl /LD` / `gcc -shared`）。`fuyubot plugin install` 只**复制**已编好的产物。"},"977":{"id":"/docs/plugin-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事                       | 说明                                                              |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回调是 `extern \"C-unwind\"` | 用 `extern \"C\"` 的话，逃出去的 panic 直接 abort 整个进程，宿主来不及 `catch_unwind` |","table":"table-1"},"978":{"id":"/docs/plugin-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事                               | 说明                        |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 一个 crate 只展开一次 `define_plugin!` | 七个符号名是 ABI 定死的，展开两次就是重复定义 |","table":"table-1"},"979":{"id":"/docs/plugin-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事             | 说明                                                               |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| ABI 版本目前是 `5` | 不匹配时宿主**拒绝加载**，不能调 `plugin_stop`，但会调 `plugin_free_handle` 把状态还回来 |","table":"table-1"},"980":{"id":"/docs/plugin-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事        | 说明                                                                             |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 订阅句柄要自己管 | `HostApi::on` 返回 `SubscriptionHandle`（`u64`），drop 不会退订；要退订就 `host.off(handle)` |","table":"table-1"},"981":{"id":"/docs/plugin-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事              | 说明                                         |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 插件 `emit` 不是广播 | 只送**自己 + 全局订阅者**（`emit_scoped`），影响别的插件要靠订阅 |","table":"table-1"},"982":{"id":"/docs/plugin-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事      | 说明                                       |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 谁分配谁释放 | 宿主绝不 free 插件的指针；宿主给的字符串是线程局部缓冲，下次宿主调用前有效 |","table":"table-1"},"983":{"id":"/docs/plugin-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"manifest 里能声明两个列表，它们决定**宿主什么时候让你跑**、以及**跑的顺序**："},"984":{"id":"/docs/plugin-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"| 字段       | 意思  | 缺了会怎样                            |\n| -------- | --- | -------------------------------- |\n| `inject` | 硬依赖 | **不激活**。停在 `Pending` 等着，等你缺的东西出现 |","table":"table-2"},"985":{"id":"/docs/plugin-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"| 字段            | 意思  | 缺了会怎样                  |\n| ------------- | --- | ---------------------- |\n| `soft_inject` | 软依赖 | 照常激活，只是排在「软依赖也齐了」的插件后面 |","table":"table-2"},"986":{"id":"/docs/plugin-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"依赖名可以写两种东西，宿主都认："},"987":{"id":"/docs/plugin-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**服务名** —— 比如 `\"storage.mongo\"`，宿主查 `Context` 里有没有这个名字"},"988":{"id":"/docs/plugin-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**插件名** —— 比如 `\"fuyubot.manage\"`，宿主查同名插件是不是 `Active`"},"989":{"id":"/docs/plugin-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"硬依赖决定能不能跑，软依赖只决定排队位置"},"990":{"id":"/docs/plugin-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"inject 里的名字不齐就不激活，停在 Pending 等着；soft_inject 只影响排序，不齐也照常激活。名字可以是服务名，也可以是插件名。"},"991":{"id":"/docs/plugin-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"inject（硬）"},"992":{"id":"/docs/plugin-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"[&quot;storage.mongo&quot;]"},"993":{"id":"/docs/plugin-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"不齐就不激活"},"994":{"id":"/docs/plugin-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"soft_inject（软）"},"995":{"id":"/docs/plugin-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"[&quot;cache.redis&quot;]"},"996":{"id":"/docs/plugin-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"只影响排队位置"},"997":{"id":"/docs/plugin-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"宿主检查：这个名字在不在？"},"998":{"id":"/docs/plugin-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"服务名或插件名都认"},"999":{"id":"/docs/plugin-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"不在"},"1000":{"id":"/docs/plugin-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"在"},"1001":{"id":"/docs/plugin-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"Pending"},"1002":{"id":"/docs/plugin-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"等着——不是失败"},"1003":{"id":"/docs/plugin-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"激活"},"1004":{"id":"/docs/plugin-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"排在有软依赖的后面"},"1005":{"id":"/docs/plugin-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"三件事值得先记住："},"1006":{"id":"/docs/plugin-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**`Pending` 不是失败。** 它表示「还没轮到」或「等的东西还没来」。真正的失败只有两种：\n你的 `plugin_start` 报错，或者你依赖的**提供者已经 `Failed`**（那时你也会被级联标成 `Failed`）。"},"1007":{"id":"/docs/plugin-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**软依赖不保证顺序。** 它只是排序偏好：软依赖齐的先上，不齐的也照样上，只是排后面。\n要「他必须先于我」就写 `inject`，别用 `soft_inject`。"},"1008":{"id":"/docs/plugin-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**依赖是准入，不是注入。** 宿主不会把那个服务的引用塞给你——你仍然自己去 `get_service`\n拿。`inject` 只保证「轮到我的时候它一定在」。"},"1009":{"id":"/docs/plugin-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"排查看 `fuyubot status`：`pending` 那一栏会列出插件名**和它还缺哪些**。"},"1010":{"id":"/docs/plugin-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"完整实例见插件联动：内置 `/help` 用共享服务暴露命令表，\n`fuyubot.start` 和 `fuyubot.manage` 用 `soft_inject` + `call_service` 把自己的命令登记进去。"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/plugin-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Rust 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rust/\" />"},"1012":{"id":"/docs/plugin-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"C 与 C++ 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/native/\" />"},"1013":{"id":"/docs/plugin-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Go 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/go/\" />"},"1014":{"id":"/docs/plugin-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"订阅与事件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/events/\" />"},"1015":{"id":"/docs/plugin-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"调用 TDLib\" href=\"/docs/plugin/tdlib/\" />"},"1016":{"id":"/docs/plugin-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"简化封装\" href=\"/docs/plugin/simplify/\" />"},"1017":{"id":"/docs/plugin-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"外部仓库插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/external/\" />"},"1018":{"id":"/docs/plugin-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"富消息\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rich/\" />"},"1019":{"id":"/docs/plugin-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"工具与中间件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/tools/\" />"},"1020":{"id":"/docs/plugin-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"异步等待\" href=\"/docs/plugin/async/\" />"},"1021":{"id":"/docs/plugin-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"ABI 契约\" href=\"/docs/plugin/abi/\" />"},"1022":{"id":"/docs/plugin-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"调试与安装\" href=\"/docs/plugin/testing/\" />"},"1023":{"id":"/docs/plugin-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"插件名只允许字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`（它会拼进源码和 TOML）；目录名里的 `.` / `-` 换成 `_` 当 crate 名\n（`fuyubot.weather` → `fuyubot_weather`）。"},"1024":{"id":"/docs/plugin-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"**原生插件名来自插件包根上的 `plugin.json`**（静态读，不加载）；没有清单的旧形态平铺 dll\n只能按文件名认。`fuyubot plugin list` 两种都列。"},"1025":{"id":"/docs/plugin-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"脚本插件的目录与身份是另一套（`plugins/scripts/<目录>/` + `[tool.fuyubot]` / `\"fuyubot\"` 段），\n见脚本插件。"},"1026":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"page","content":"插件联动","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage"},"1027":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage","content":"用共享服务互相调用、用软依赖排好启动顺序——以内置 /help 的命令注册为例"},"1028":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"先选通道"},"1029":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"`/help` 的联动结构"},"1030":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#提供方把能力做成服务","content":"提供方：把能力做成服务"},"1031":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#1-写方法","content":"1. 写方法"},"1032":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"2. 打包 VTable 与它引用的缓冲"},"1033":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#3-start-注册stop-放下","content":"3. `start()` 注册，`stop()` 放下"},"1034":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#4-提供方也要能单独活","content":"4. 提供方也要能单独活"},"1035":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"消费方：按名字调用 + 软依赖"},"1036":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"`soft_inject` 做了什么、没做什么"},"1037":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"软依赖写服务名还是插件名？"},"1038":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"软还是硬？"},"1039":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"生命周期与所有权"},"1040":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"其它语言"},"1041":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"排查"},"1042":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"一页检查清单"},"1043":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage","content":"插件之间没有共享的 Rust 类型，也没有彼此的符号表。原生插件（cdylib）跑在同一个进程里，\n但只通过宿主的 C ABI 打交道。想「A 把自己的能力借给 B 用」，只有宿主提供的那几条通道。"},"1044":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage","content":"这篇讲最常用的一条：**命名服务 + 软依赖**。例子就是内置的 `/help`——\n它把命令表暴露成一个进程级服务，`fuyubot.start` 和 `fuyubot.manage` 在启动时把自己的命令登记进去，\n而它们之间没有一行互相 import 的代码。"},"1045":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"| 想做的事             | 通道               | 有返回值 | 对方必须在？ |\n| ---------------- | ---------------- | ---- | ------ |\n| 广播「发生了什么」，不关心谁在听 | 事件总线 `emit` / 订阅 | 否    | 否      |","table":"table-0"},"1046":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"| 想做的事            | 通道                                               | 有返回值        | 对方必须在？   |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ----------- | -------- |\n| 调一个能力，**当场要结果** | 命名服务 `provide_service(_shared)` + `call_service` | 是（JSON 字符串） | 是（调用那一刻） |","table":"table-0"},"1047":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"| 想做的事            | 通道                                | 有返回值 | 对方必须在？ |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------- | ---- | ------ |\n| 让宿主 / AI 能发现并调用 | 工具表 `register_tool` + `call_tool` | 是    | 是      |","table":"table-0"},"1048":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"| 想做的事           | 通道                       | 有返回值 | 对方必须在？ |\n| -------------- | ------------------------ | ---- | ------ |\n| 只要求「我启动时它已经在了」 | `inject` / `soft_inject` | —    | 不负责传值  |","table":"table-0"},"1049":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"服务适合「一个插件提供能力、其它插件按名字调」：命令注册表、缓存、鉴权、数据源都属于这一类。\n它不替代事件——事件是**通知**，服务是**调用**。两者可以叠：服务方法内部照样能 `emit`。"},"1050":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"内置 `/help` 把命令表暴露成进程级服务 `fuyubot.help.commands`，方法有两个："},"1051":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"| 方法         | 入参                                      | 返回                                            |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `register` | `{\"name\":\"start\",\"description\":\"开始使用\"}` | `{\"ok\":true}`；坏入参回 `{\"ok\":false,\"error\":\"…\"}` |","table":"table-1"},"1052":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"| 方法     | 入参  | 返回                                                          |\n| ------ | --- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `list` | 忽略  | `[{\"name\":\"start\",\"description\":\"…\"}, …]`，即 `/help` 实际渲染的内容 |","table":"table-1"},"1053":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"服务名建议用反向域名（`fuyubot.help.commands`），方法名用动词；协议字段**只增不改**，\n破坏性改动时把 `ServiceVTable.version` 加一（宿主不校验，但调用方可以据此判断）。\n坏入参不要 panic——回一个带 `error` 的 JSON，调用方才有机会降级。"},"1054":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"三个插件各管一段："},"1055":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"| 角色  | 插件             | 做什么                                                               |\n| --- | -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 提供方 | `fuyubot.help` | `start()` 里 `provide_service_shared` 注册服务；`/help` 渲染时合并静态基线与动态注册表 |","table":"table-2"},"1056":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"| 角色  | 插件              | 做什么                                                              |\n| --- | --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 消费方 | `fuyubot.start` | `soft_inject` 声明软依赖；`start()` 里 `call_service(…, \"register\", …)` |","table":"table-2"},"1057":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"| 角色  | 插件               | 做什么              |\n| --- | ---------------- | ---------------- |\n| 消费方 | `fuyubot.manage` | 同上，登记 `/plugins` |","table":"table-2"},"1058":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"消费方**不链接** help 插件，也不 import 它的任何代码。它只认两个字符串——服务名和方法名——\n外加一份两边都认的 JSON 协议。"},"1059":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"> 实例源码在运行时仓库的 `plugins/fuyubot-plugin-help`、`plugins/fuyubot-plugin-start`、\n> `plugins/fuyubot-plugin-manage`；这篇只摘和联动有关的部分。"},"1060":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#提供方把能力做成服务","content":"下面代码用 `fuyubot-abi` 的类型写（三个内置插件就是这么写的）。外部 Rust 插件直接依赖\ncrates.io 上的 `fuyubot-abi` 即可，拿到的是同一套 `ServiceVTable` / `ServiceMethod` /\n`Plugin` / `define_plugin!`。"},"1061":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#1-写方法","content":"服务方法只有一个签名：收 JSON、回 JSON（或 `NULL` 表示「成功但没输出」）。"},"1062":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#1-写方法","content":"方法跑在**调用方线程**上。消费方若在命令回调（接收循环线程）里调它，这里就不能做慢事——\n否则整个宿主一起卡住。要慢慢做的活，在方法里排个队、立刻返回。"},"1063":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#1-写方法","content":"⚠️ `ServiceMethodFn` 是 `extern \"C\"`，**方法里不能有 panic**：逃出这个边界的 panic 会直接\nabort 整个宿主，不是只挂你的插件。解析失败回 `{\"ok\":false,\"error\":\"…\"}`；确实可能 panic 的\n代码段自己 `catch_unwind`。"},"1064":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"`ServiceVTable` 里全是裸指针：`name` 指向服务名，`methods` 指向方法数组，每个方法项又指向\n自己的名字。这些缓冲必须和 VTable **活一样久**，所以打包进同一个结构体，一起放进 `Box`："},"1065":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"这里有几个容易写错的点："},"1066":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"`Vec` 的**堆缓冲**在结构体移动时不会跟着搬，所以 `Box::new` 之后 `names[i].as_ptr()` /\n`methods.as_ptr()` 仍然有效。**别在注册之后再 `push`**——重新分配会让宿主手里的指针悬空。"},"1067":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"`version` 是提供方自己的协议版本，宿主**不校验**；它只用于调用方自己判断。"},"1068":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"`context` 会原样传给每个方法。需要实例状态就把 `self` 指针放这里；`/help` 用的是进程级\n`static` 注册表，所以留空。"},"1069":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#3-start-注册stop-放下","content":"**跨插件共享必须用 `provide_service_shared`。** `provide_service` 写的是调用者自己的\n子作用域，兄弟插件沿父链往上看不到它；两个插件各注册一份同名私有服务也不会冲突，\n但也就谈不上联动。`_shared` 写进程级的根表，同名会和别人撞——所以它必须显眼。"},"1070":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#3-start-注册stop-放下","content":"`ServiceHandle` **不是** RAII：它没有 `Drop`，丢在一边不会注销。正常也不需要手动注销——\n插件卸载时宿主按 owner 回滚它注册的一切，共享服务也一样（写在根表也记得 owner）。\n这里的 `Option<Box<HelpService>>` 只是为了**保活 VTable**，不是为了「用句柄控制注册」。"},"1071":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#4-提供方也要能单独活","content":"`/help` 的静态基线 `BUILTIN_COMMANDS` 始终包含 `start` / `help` / `plugins` 三个命令；\n动态注册表只是叠加，渲染时按名字去重。所以："},"1072":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#4-提供方也要能单独活","content":"没有消费方登记命令，`/help` 仍然列得出内置三件套；"},"1073":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#4-提供方也要能单独活","content":"消费方没起来，只是少几条动态说明，不会让 `/help` 整个失效。"},"1074":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#4-提供方也要能单独活","content":"这是可选联动的通用做法：**提供方给自己留一份能独立工作的兜底**，别把「有人来调我」\n当成自己启动的前提。"},"1075":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"`fuyubot.start` 的接线只有两段：`start()` 里调服务，`soft_inject()` 里声明排队偏好。"},"1076":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"`call_service` 是普通安全函数，返回 `Result<String, AbiError>`："},"1077":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"服务不存在 / 方法不存在 / 方法指针是 `None` → `Err`；"},"1078":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"方法返回 `NULL` → `Ok(String::new())`（「成功但没输出」）；"},"1079":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"方法返回字符串 → 立刻拷成 `String`，调用方拿到的是自己的一份，可以随便留着。"},"1080":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"⚠️ 目前错误类型不细分「服务不存在」和「没有这个方法」，都是 `AbiError::BadString`。\n所以日志里要把服务名、方法名一起打出来，否则排查时只看得到一句「失败了」。"},"1081":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"宿主在 `plugin_init` **之前**读 `plugin_manifest` 里的依赖列表（`define_plugin!` 会把\n`Plugin::soft_inject()` 写进去）。同步阶段分两轮："},"1082":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"先激活「硬依赖齐 **且** 软依赖也齐」的插件；"},"1083":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"再激活「只有硬依赖齐」的插件。"},"1084":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"所以同一批加载时，只要 help 能正常起来，它一定先于 `/start` 和 `/plugins` 激活——\n不管文件名的字典序怎样。"},"1085":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"但它**不是**「提供方一定在」的保证："},"1086":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"如果 help 自己卡在硬依赖上（停在 `Pending`），消费方的软依赖就不算齐，第二轮照样会激活\n消费方。这时 `call_service` 会失败。"},"1087":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"如果 help 的 `start()` 报错（`Failed`），软依赖同样不阻塞消费方。"},"1088":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"运行期中提供方被卸载，消费方仍然处于 `Active`、不会重新跑 `start()`；之后的每次调用\n都要自己处理错误。"},"1089":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"一句话：**软依赖管排队，不管可用性**。所以上面的 `match` 分支不是客套，是必须的。"},"1090":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"`inject` / `soft_inject` 里的名字，宿主认两种："},"1091":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"| 写法                             | 宿主查什么                    | 什么时候用                 |\n| ------------------------------ | ------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| 服务名（`\"fuyubot.help.commands\"`） | 根作用域的 `Context` 里有没有这个名字 | 推荐。换一个插件提供同名服务，排序仍然成立 |","table":"table-3"},"1092":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"| 写法                    | 宿主查什么              | 什么时候用               |\n| --------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------- |\n| 插件名（`\"fuyubot.help\"`） | 有没有同名插件处于 `Active` | 只关心「那个插件」而不是「那个能力」时 |","table":"table-3"},"1093":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"⚠️ 软依赖写**私有**服务名是排不上序的：兄弟插件看不到它，管理器在根作用域里也查不到。\n跨插件的能力一律走 `provide_service_shared`，依赖也写同一个服务名。"},"1094":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"| 场景                      | 选择                    |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------- |\n| 没有 `/help` 也要能跑，只是少一条登记 | `soft_inject` + 运行期降级 |","table":"table-4"},"1095":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"| 场景                     | 选择            |\n| ---------------------- | ------------- |\n| 没有数据库 / 鉴权就完全没意义，宁可别启动 | `inject`（硬依赖） |","table":"table-4"},"1096":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"| 场景                 | 选择                 |\n| ------------------ | ------------------ |\n| 只要求「它先起来」，不直接调它的服务 | `soft_inject` 写插件名 |","table":"table-4"},"1097":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"| 场景             | 选择                 |\n| -------------- | ------------------ |\n| 能力名稳定、可能有替代提供者 | `soft_inject` 写服务名 |","table":"table-4"},"1098":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"硬依赖的语义是**准入**：缺了就不激活，停在 `Pending` 等；如果提供它的插件已经 `Failed`，\n依赖方会被级联标成 `Failed`，而不是永远假装在等。但它也不传值——到了 `start()` 里，\n你仍然要自己 `get_service` / `call_service`。"},"1099":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"依赖声明不要写进配置：manifest 是权威来源，`define_plugin!` 从 trait 自动生成。\n只有没有 `plugin_manifest` 的 v3 老插件，宿主才回退到 `[plugin.<名字>].inject` /\n`.soft_inject`（manifest 该侧非空时**覆盖**配置，不是合并）。见插件总览。"},"1100":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事      | 规则                                      |\n| ------ | --------------------------------------- |\n| 什么时候注册 | `start()`。`init()` 阶段插件还没被准入，别在那时对外暴露能力 |","table":"table-5"},"1101":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事         | 规则                                       |\n| --------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 注册进宿主的是什么 | 裸指针，**不复制**。VTable 和它引用的字符串 / 方法数组必须一直活着 |","table":"table-5"},"1102":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事      | 规则                                                                |\n| ------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 什么时候释放 | `plugin_stop` 先跑，然后宿主 `rollback_owner` 撤销注册。`stop()` 里放下 `Box` 即可 |","table":"table-5"},"1103":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事    | 规则                                                                 |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 同名冲突 | `provide_service_shared` 返回无效句柄，宿主只打一条 `warn`；调用方必须检查 `is_valid()` |","table":"table-5"},"1104":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事     | 规则                       |\n| ----- | ------------------------ |\n| 方法返回值 | 提供方持有，宿主当场拷走；不要跨调用保存那个指针 |","table":"table-5"},"1105":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事                 | 规则                         |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `get_service` 的指针 | 同样是借的。别长期缓存——提供方一旦卸载，指针就悬空 |","table":"table-5"},"1106":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事     | 规则                                   |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 方法在哪跑 | 调用方线程，同步执行。命令回调里调服务 = 在接收循环线程上跑，不能阻塞 |","table":"table-5"},"1107":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事     | 规则                                               |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| 输入可信吗 | 共享服务任何插件都能调。方法里自己校验 JSON、限制大小、别信 `context` 之外的东西 |","table":"table-5"},"1108":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"| 语言   | 提供方                                          | 消费方                                     |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| Rust | `provide_service` / `provide_service_shared` | `call_service`，或 `get_service` + 自己扫方法表 |","table":"table-6"},"1109":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"| 语言      | 提供方                | 消费方                                             |\n| ------- | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| C / C++ | VTable 里第 9 / 20 项 | `get_service` + 按 `method_count` 扫 `methods[i]` |","table":"table-6"},"1110":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"| 语言  | 提供方                       | 消费方 |\n| --- | ------------------------- | --- |\n| Go  | 同上（c-shared 不能卸载，见 ABI 页） | 同上  |","table":"table-6"},"1111":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"| 语言               | 提供方  | 消费方                  |\n| ---------------- | ---- | -------------------- |\n| Python / JS / TS | 暂不支持 | 薄 SDK 还没暴露服务调用，见脚本插件 |","table":"table-6"},"1112":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"C 侧的字段布局与调用示例见 插件 ABI 和\n原生插件。"},"1113":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"`/help` 里少了一条命令：先看 `start` / `manage` 的日志有没有\n`… 已向 /help 注册命令：{\"ok\":true}`；失败那条会带 `call_service` 的错误。"},"1114":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"服务注册失败：宿主日志里有一行 `注册共享服务 … 失败: 命名服务 … 已经注册过了`\n（或「收到了空 vtable」）。"},"1115":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"谁在跑、谁在等：`/plugins` 走宿主预置的 `fuyubot.host.plugins` 服务，会列出\n`active` / `pending`（带 `missing`）/ `failed`（带 `reason`）；`fuyubot status` 读的是\n实例发布的同一份快照（摘要 + pending / failed 明细）。"},"1116":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"依赖声明从哪来：`plugin_manifest`。激活时日志里那行\n`激活 <名字> v<版本>（硬依赖 N、软依赖 M）` 就是宿主实际读到的数量；`status` 里的\n`pending` / `missing` 也是按它算的。别只改配置——manifest 非空时配置那份会被覆盖。"},"1117":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"提供方用 `provide_service_shared`，方法名和 JSON 协议写进文档。"},"1118":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"VTable、方法数组、名字缓冲装在同一个 `Box` 里，注册后不再扩容。"},"1119":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"检查 `ServiceHandle::is_valid()`；`stop()` 里放下持有物，不手动 free 宿主的东西。"},"1120":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-93","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"消费方对 `call_service` 的失败有降级分支，不 `unwrap`。"},"1121":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-94","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"可选联动用 `soft_inject`，并接受「提供方可能不在」；缺了就活不了才用 `inject`。"},"1122":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-95","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"方法里不做慢活、不阻塞调用方线程；也不让 panic 逃出 `extern \"C\"` 边界。"},"1123":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"page","content":"迁移到目录包","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration"},"1124":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration","content":"把平铺的 dll 和旧脚本插件改成 plugins/<id>/ 结构"},"1125":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#先看现在是什么形态","content":"先看现在是什么形态"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"自动迁移"},"1127":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#手工迁移","content":"手工迁移"},"1128":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#原生插件","content":"原生插件"},"1129":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#脚本插件","content":"脚本插件"},"1130":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#验证","content":"验证"},"1131":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#回滚","content":"回滚"},"1132":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"1133":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration","content":"旧版本把原生插件平铺在 `plugins/*.dll`，现在推荐一个插件一个目录："},"1134":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration","content":"平铺 dll 仍然能加载，但目录包才有静态元数据：`plugin list` 能显示版本、依赖、平台，\n商店和安装器也能按 `plugin.json` 校验。新插件请直接用目录包。"},"1135":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#先看现在是什么形态","content":"输出会分成「目录包 / 旧平铺 dll / 脚本插件 / 已禁用」几段。只有旧形态需要迁移。"},"1136":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"先空跑，确认它准备做什么："},"1137":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"确认后执行："},"1138":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"它会："},"1139":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"对每个平铺 dll（带同名 `.dll.disable` 的也认）读取导出信息，取插件 id 和版本；"},"1140":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"新建 `plugins/<id>/bin/`，把 dll 和它旁边同名的依赖文件一起移进去；"},"1141":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"写一份 `plugin.json`；"},"1142":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"对旧脚本目录补一个 `plugin.json`（脚本本身不动）；"},"1143":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"内置插件和已经是目录包的插件跳过，重复执行不会重复迁移。"},"1144":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"迁移完再跑一次 `fuyubot plugin list`，然后启动实例验证。"},"1145":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"> Go 编译的 c-shared 插件在迁移时会**永久映射**进当前进程，迁移进程随后退出，不会再卸载它。\n> 这是正常现象；`--dry-run` 不会写文件。"},"1146":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#手工迁移","content":"自动迁移不适用时，按下面的步骤做。"},"1147":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#原生插件","content":"建目录 `plugins/<id>/bin/`；"},"1148":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#原生插件","content":"把 `weather.dll` 移进去，旁边运行时需要的依赖库也一起移；"},"1149":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#原生插件","content":"在 `plugins/<id>/plugin.json` 写："},"1150":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#原生插件","content":"`id` 必须和插件 `plugin_init` 返回的名字一致；`version` 写真实版本，不要写 `0.0.0`。"},"1151":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#脚本插件","content":"脚本插件仍然放在 `plugins/scripts/<目录>/`，只需要补一个可选的 `plugin.json`："},"1152":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#脚本插件","content":"`kind` 写 `python` 或 `js`，`entry` 指向入口脚本。脚本自己的 `pyproject.toml` /\n`package.json` 保持原样。"},"1153":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#验证","content":"`plugin list` 里能看到目录包，版本、平台、依赖都对；"},"1154":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#验证","content":"回放 / 启动日志里没有 `BundleNameMismatch`、`PlatformMismatch`、`EntryMissing`；"},"1155":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#验证","content":"原来的命令、服务和配置段还能用。"},"1156":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#回滚","content":"迁移只是移动文件，没有改插件本体："},"1157":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#回滚","content":"把 `plugins/<id>/bin/` 里的 dll 和依赖移回 `plugins/`；"},"1158":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#回滚","content":"删掉 `plugins/<id>/`；"},"1159":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#回滚","content":"脚本插件删掉新加的 `plugin.json` 即可。"},"1160":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#回滚","content":"回滚前先停掉正在运行的实例。"},"1161":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"**迁移后插件没加载**"},"1162":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"平铺 dll 和目录包同时存在时，两个都会被扫到，可能重复注册。迁移是「移动」，\n正常情况下不会同时存在；手工迁移时记得删掉平铺那份。"},"1163":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"检查 `plugin.json` 的 `id` 是否与 `plugin_init` 的名字一致。"},"1164":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"**提示 `GoRequiresManifest`**"},"1165":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"Go 插件没有 `plugin.json` 时加载器拒绝加载，因为 Go 的库一旦映射就不能卸载。\n先迁移出 `plugin.json` 再启动；或者用 `fuyubot plugin migrate` 处理。"},"1166":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"**提示 `platforms` 不匹配**"},"1167":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"`platforms` 为空或 `[\"any\"]` 表示全平台；否则必须包含当前系统，例如\n`windows-x86_64`、`linux-aarch64`、`macos-aarch64`。"},"1168":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"**脚本插件被当成原生插件**"},"1169":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"脚本目录要放在 `plugins/scripts/` 下，不要放在 `plugins/` 根上。"},"1170":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"**配置段还需要改吗**"},"1171":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"不需要。配置段仍是 `[plugin.<id>]`；迁移只改目录结构，不改插件 id。"},"1172":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"page","content":"C 与 C++ 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native"},"1173":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"同一份头文件、extern \"C\"、用你自己的工具链编译"},"1174":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"七个符号"},"1175":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#c","content":"C"},"1176":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"C++"},"1177":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"常用 ABI 怎么调（C / C++ 同一套）"},"1178":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"编译（你自己的工具链）"},"1179":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"1180":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage`（或者用 `simplify_invoke`）"},"1181":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"注意"},"1182":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"C 与 C++ 用**同一份头文件** `fuyubot_plugin.h`，差别只有两条：导出符号要不要放进 `extern \"C\"`，\n以及用什么拼 JSON。头文件是**产物**，不是源码——它由 cbindgen 从 `fuyubot-abi` 的 Rust 定义生成，\n权威副本是 `fuyubot_abi::PLUGIN_HEADER`，别手改。"},"1183":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"C / C++ / Go 没有 async 运行时：请求与更新用回调（`on`），工具结果用\n`call_tool_result` 同步拿。Rust 侧有 `ResponseRouter`（可 await），见 异步等待；\n脚本侧有自己的异步写法，见脚本插件。"},"1184":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"工程里加一个 `build.rs` 把头文件落出来（与 Rust 插件同一个来源）："},"1185":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"`cargo build` 之后工程根上就有 `fuyubot_plugin.h`；C 与 C++ 共用这一份。"},"1186":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"v3 是四件套，v4 又加了三个（都可以不写，但写了才有对应能力）。"},"1187":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗    | 说明                                                           |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `plugin_init` | **必须** | 比 `host->version != ABI_VERSION`，存下 VTable，返回 `PluginHandle` |","table":"table-0"},"1188":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号             | 必须吗 | 说明                |\n| -------------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | 可选  | 订阅/注册；返回 `0` 表示成功 |","table":"table-0"},"1189":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗 | 说明                |\n| ------------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | 可选  | 清状态；只登记元数据的插件可以不写 |","table":"table-0"},"1190":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗    | 说明                                                |\n| -------------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | **必须** | 释放本插件 `malloc` 出来的字符串（`plugin_manifest` 返回的那块也走它） |","table":"table-0"},"1191":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                | 必须吗   | 说明                                                            |\n| ----------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_manifest` | v4 可选 | 返回自描述 JSON（名字 / 版本 / `inject` / `soft_inject`），宿主在 `init` 之前读 |","table":"table-0"},"1192":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                    | 必须吗   | 说明                                   |\n| --------------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot_abi_version` | v4 可选 | 静态返回 `ABI_VERSION`；宿主与静态检查工具不加载也能看到它 |","table":"table-0"},"1193":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗   | 说明                                                 |\n| -------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_handle` | v4 可选 | ABI 版本不匹配时宿主靠它回收 `init` 分配的状态（那时不能调 `plugin_stop`） |","table":"table-0"},"1194":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"`PluginHandle` 的判据是「`abi_version != 0` **且** `context` 非空」，所以 `context` 不能给 `NULL`。\n版本不对就返回全零句柄，宿主会把它当成拒绝加载。"},"1195":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c","content":"`ABI_VERSION` 与 `FUYUBOT_EXPORT` 都来自头文件，不要自己写死。"},"1196":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"同 C，**唯一的硬差别**是七个导出符号必须在 `extern \"C\"` 里——C++ 会改函数名（mangling），\n宿主按 ABI 定死的名字 `dlsym`，改了就找不到。"},"1197":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"`C-unwind` 对 C/C++ 而言与普通 C 调用**ABI 一致**，但 C++ 的异常照样能穿过这个边界——\n逃到宿主那边的异常是未定义行为。**在回调内部把异常处理完再返回**。"},"1198":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"每个函数第一个参数都是 `g_host->host_ctx`。下面把常用的走了一遍："},"1199":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"⚠️ 三条所有权规则（跨界最容易出事的地方）："},"1200":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"`td_execute` / `get_config` / `call_tool_result` / `list_tools` / `list_plugins` 返回的\n`const char *` 是**宿主线程局部缓冲**，下一次宿主调用之前有效——要留就当场 `strdup`，\n**不要 free 它**。"},"1201":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"反过来，只有 `plugin_manifest` 返回的那块是**你自己 malloc 的**，宿主读完用\n`plugin_free_string` 还给你（所以必须真能 free，别返回静态字符串）。"},"1202":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"`on` 的 `filter_json` 里 `event_type` 键只用来**选通道**，不参与负载匹配。"},"1203":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"`/utf-8` 省掉的后果很难看：中文注释被按系统代码页拆坏，编译器报的是「注释提前结束、后面全是语法错误」。"},"1204":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"编完装进插件目录："},"1205":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"每个插件在 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下有自己的一段配置（见配置文件）。\nC 侧直接调 VTable 上那两个函数："},"1206":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"两点与其它函数一致：**返回值是宿主线程局部缓冲**（读完即弃，别 free）；`set_config`\n**没有 section 参数**——宿主按调用者身份判定，所以插件无法伪造写别人的段。"},"1207":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"> ✅ **ABI v5 起，这一节只是「另一条路」，不再是唯一的路。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑\n> 同一份 `fuyubot-simplify` 代码，经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张\n> **op 表**（`{\"op\":\"send_message\",\"args\":{…}}`），所有语言都能用——发消息等结局、超时撤回、\n> bot 与用户号挑不同反应方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树，都不用手写。\n> 见 ABI › simplify 操作表。\n> C / C++ **不需要**任何封装——直接调 VTable 上的 `simplify_invoke` /\n> `simplify_invoke_result`（见下），或者照下面手写 `sendMessage`。"},"1208":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"先来一个能跑的：直接调 VTable 上的 `simplify_invoke` 发消息——宿主替你解析文本、等到真发出去、\n超时先撤回；结果经已有的 `\"response\"` 事件回投（带 `request_id`，与你收 TDLib 响应是同一个 `on` 通道）："},"1209":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"`on_update` 里按 `request_id == rid` 配对，就能从那条 `response` 事件里取出 `simplifyResult` JSON\n（和 `td_invoke_simplified` 的响应是同一个 `on` 通道，逻辑完全复用）。"},"1210":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage` 是**另一条路**——下面这些字段你都得自己拼对："},"1211":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                    |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 纯文本   | `input_message_content` = `inputMessageText`，`text` 是 `formattedText`（`text` + `entities`） |","table":"table-1"},"1212":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果           | 手写的关键字段                                                                                              |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Markdown / HTML | **不自己解析**：先 `td_execute` 调 `parseTextEntities`（`version: 2` = MarkdownV2），把返回的 `formattedText` 原样塞进去 |","table":"table-1"},"1213":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                 |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回复某条  | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\": \"inputMessageReplyToMessage\", \"message_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"1214":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                            |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 发到话题  | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\": \"messageTopicForum\", \"forum_topic_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"1215":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                     |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内联按钮  | `reply_markup` = `replyMarkupInlineKeyboard`；callback 的 `data` 是 **base64** |","table":"table-1"},"1216":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果     | 手写的关键字段                                 |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 静音 / 保护内容 | 在 `options`（`messageSendOptions`）里，不是顶层 |","table":"table-1"},"1217":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果    | 手写的关键字段                                                      |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 等到「真发出去」 | 请求号只到**临时消息**；要最终 `Message` 得再等 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` |","table":"table-1"},"1218":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"要 Markdown 就分两步：先 `td_execute` 拿 `parseTextEntities` 的结果（一个 `formattedText`），\n把它的 `text` 与 `entities` 拼进上面的 `input_message_content`。方法名与字段名以\n`td_api.tl` 为准（见调用 TDLib）。"},"1219":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"模板里的 JSON 取值是**朴素查找**（`strstr`），不处理转义、不处理同名嵌套键；认真写就引一个 JSON 库。"},"1220":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"宿主返回的字符串是**线程局部缓冲**，只在下一次宿主调用之前有效——当场拷走，并且**不要试图释放它**。"},"1221":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"`set_config` 回写是**全量重写** `fuyubot.toml`，手写注释会丢（见上面「读 / 写配置」）。"},"1222":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"想少拼 JSON，可以只发 `td_invoke_simplified` 需要的参数对象（`@type` 由宿主补），见 调用 TDLib。"},"1223":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"page","content":"富消息","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich"},"1224":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"messageRichMessage：块树排版、按钮行与本地 Markdown 转换"},"1225":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"三种源"},"1226":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"发送与编辑"},"1227":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"按钮"},"1228":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"行内富文本：`richtext`"},"1229":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"覆盖靠测试钉着"},"1230":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"TDLib 的富消息（`messageRichMessage`）是「一页排版」的消息：标题、段落、表格、代码块、\n按钮行……全是一块一块的**页块**（`InputPageBlock`），行内另有独立的富文本（`RichText`）。\nBot API 管它叫 Rich Messages。"},"1231":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"TDLib 里**没有** `sendRichMessage` / `editRichMessage`，也没有自带的 md → 块树转换；\n`fuyubot-simplify` 的 `RichMessage` 把这层补齐了：发送 / 编辑就是\n`sendMessage` / `editMessageText` + `inputMessageRichMessage`，Markdown 转换在**本地**完成。"},"1232":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"RichMessage：三种构建方式，两个出口"},"1233":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown、服务端 HTML、手拼块树三条路都能产出同一个 RichMessage 类型；它只有两个出口——发送和编辑，各自落到对应的 TDLib 方法。"},"1234":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown"},"1235":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"from_markdown（本地转）"},"1236":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown / HTML"},"1237":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"server_markdown / server_html"},"1238":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"块树"},"1239":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"from_blocks（最底层）"},"1240":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"RichMessage"},"1241":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"三种方式产出同一个类型，下游只认它"},"1242":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"send_rich_message"},"1243":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"edit_rich_message"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"sendMessage"},"1245":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"+ inputMessageRichMessage"},"1246":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"editMessageText"},"1247":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"+ inputMessageRichMessage"},"1248":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"`RichMessage` 内部是 `RichSource` 三选一："},"1249":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源      | 构造                               | 谁解析                              | 谁能发  |\n| ------ | -------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ---- |\n| Blocks | `RichMessage::from_markdown(md)` | **本地**转换器（对齐官方 Rich Markdown 全表） | 任何账号 |","table":"table-0"},"1250":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源      | 构造                                 | 谁解析                                | 谁能发  |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ---- |\n| Blocks | `RichMessage::from_blocks(blocks)` | 你给现成块树（每块一条 `InputPageBlock` JSON） | 任何账号 |","table":"table-0"},"1251":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源        | 构造                                 | 谁解析              | 谁能发   |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------- | ---------------- | ----- |\n| Markdown | `RichMessage::server_markdown(md)` | **服务端**（发前拿不到块树） | 仅 bot |","table":"table-0"},"1252":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源    | 构造                               | 谁解析     | 谁能发   |\n| ---- | -------------------------------- | ------- | ----- |\n| Html | `RichMessage::server_html(html)` | **服务端** | 仅 bot |","table":"table-0"},"1253":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"本地转换器对着官方 Rich Markdown 表\n一类一例全覆盖：标题 / 段落 / 围栏代码（含 `math`）/ 引用与可展开引用 / 拉引 / 页脚 /\n列表与任务项 / 表格 / 分割线 / 公式 / 折叠块 / 拼贴与幻灯片 / 媒体（按扩展名猜类型）/\n地图 / 锚点 / 按钮行 / 思考占位 / 脚注；行内粗斜删码、标记、剧透、上下标、行内公式、\n自定义 emoji、时间、`mailto:` / `tel:` / `tg://user` / 锚点链接，以及那批 HTML 标签\n（`<u>` `<details>` `<tg-collage>` `<tg-button-row>` …）。**不认的一律当普通文本**\n（引用式链接、`<table>` 这类 HTML 块不会报错，只是原样保留）。"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"参数是 `RichMessageParams`——与 `SendMessageParams` **分开的类型**（那边是「文本 + 媒体」\n二选一，混在一起互斥规则没人记得住）：`message` / `reply_to_message_id` / `topic_id`\n（`Option<Topic>`，见Simplify 封装）/ `reply_markup` /\n`clear_draft` / `timeout_ms`。"},"1255":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"和 `Simplify` 的其它方法一样，**等到结果才返回**（详见调用 TDLib）："},"1256":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"| 方法                                                         | 发出的 `@type`   | 等到什么               | 返回                                                    |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify::send_rich_message(chat_id, &RichMessageParams)` | `sendMessage` | 响应 + 发送结局（成功 / 失败） | 最终 `Message`（⚠️ **阻塞**，回调里用 `send_rich_message_then`） |","table":"table-1"},"1257":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"| 方法                                                                     | 发出的 `@type`       | 等到什么 | 返回                                           |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ---- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify::edit_rich_message(chat_id, message_id, &RichMessageParams)` | `editMessageText` | 响应   | 改完的 `Message`（回调里用 `edit_rich_message_then`） |","table":"table-1"},"1258":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"最常用的两条捷径："},"1259":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"按钮在 Markdown 里**没有语法**，一律显式构造：`RichButton::url / callback / user / copy_text`\n（`.style(RichButtonStyle)` 换样式），用 `with_buttons` / `with_button_row` 追加\n`inputPageBlockButtonRow`。"},"1260":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"`with_buttons` 只对 **Blocks 源**成立——`server_markdown` / `server_html` 的按钮要用\n服务端语法自己写进文本，对它们调 `with_buttons` 会报 `RichSourceNotBlocks`。"},"1261":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"块里的行内内容是独立的 `RichText`（31 个构造器，没有 offset/length）：\nMarkdown 语法能覆盖 21 个，剩下 10 个（`mention` / `hashtag` / `cashtag` /\n`bankCardNumber` / `tonAddress` / `botCommand` / `icon` / `button` / `diff` / `anchor`）\n没有 md 写法，用 `richtext::*` 拼好塞进块（配合 `with_block`）。"},"1262":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"`InputPageBlock` 一共 24 个构造器，本地转换器**全都能产出**（`thinking` 只能出现在草稿消息里，\n结构上仍可构造）；`with_block` 也留给「媒体已上传、要传 `inputPhoto` 句柄」这类 md 表达不了的场景。"},"1263":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"块级语法**一类一例**：`block_syntax_covers_the_official_table`（每块都再走一遍\n`td_api::InputPageBlock` 反序列化）；整段全格式回归闸是内联的 `official_sample_fully_deserializes`。"},"1264":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"加块 / 删块会让 `input_page_block_coverage_is_accounted_for` 失败——24 个构造器的\n分工表就烤在这条测试里。"},"1265":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"相关：调用 TDLib（`Simplify` 的其余方法）、插件总览。"},"1266":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"page","content":"Rust 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust"},"1267":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust","content":"依赖 fuyubot-abi，实现 Plugin trait + define_plugin! 的最小写法"},"1268":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#依赖","content":"依赖"},"1269":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#最小可用插件","content":"最小可用插件"},"1270":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"`Plugin` trait"},"1271":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调与状态","content":"回调与状态"},"1272":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"1273":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"常用 ABI 速查"},"1274":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#注册一个带处理器的工具","content":"注册一个带处理器的工具"},"1275":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"编译与安装"},"1276":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust","content":"Rust 插件只依赖一个 crate：`fuyubot-abi`。\n它给出 `HostApi`（VTable 的 Rust 封装）、`Plugin` trait、`define_plugin!` 宏与\n`ResponseRouter`；**没有第二层 SDK**——写插件就是实现一个 trait，再把 C ABI 导出交给宏。"},"1277":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#依赖","content":"那个空的 `[workspace]` 不是多余的：没有它，cargo 会一路往上找父目录的 workspace 声明然后报错。\n`fuyubot-abi` 的版本号跟着宿主走（当前 ABI 版本是 **5**）。"},"1278":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#最小可用插件","content":"`define_plugin!(类型, \"插件名\")` 展开出七个导出符号\n（`plugin_init` / `plugin_start` / `plugin_stop` / `plugin_free_string` /\n`plugin_free_handle` / `fuyubot_abi_version` / `plugin_manifest`），\n并把插件的名字、crate 版本、`inject` / `soft_inject` 填进 `plugin_manifest`。"},"1279":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                                   | 对应符号          | 说明                   |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------- | -------------------- |\n| `init(host) -> Result<Self, String>` | `plugin_init` | 构造状态；返回 `Err` = 拒绝加载 |","table":"table-0"},"1280":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                                                    | 对应符号           | 说明                                  |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | -------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `start(&mut self, config_json) -> Result<(), String>` | `plugin_start` | 订阅 / 注册都写在这里；`config_json` 是宿主传来的配置 |","table":"table-0"},"1281":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                | 对应符号          | 说明                          |\n| ----------------- | ------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `stop(&mut self)` | `plugin_stop` | 可选，回收 `Box::into_raw` 之类的状态 |","table":"table-0"},"1282":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                        | 对应符号              | 说明        |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------- | --------- |\n| `inject() -> Vec<String>` | `plugin_manifest` | 硬依赖：缺了不激活 |","table":"table-0"},"1283":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                             | 对应符号              | 说明          |\n| ------------------------------ | ----------------- | ----------- |\n| `soft_inject() -> Vec<String>` | `plugin_manifest` | 软依赖：只影响排队顺序 |","table":"table-0"},"1284":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"`define_plugin!` 还把 `init` / `start` / `stop` 包在 `catch_unwind` 里——和回调的\n`C-unwind` 是两层，**两层都要**：一层防 panic 逃出 ABI，一层防 panic 把宿主线程带走。"},"1285":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调与状态","content":"回调是裸函数指针，没有捕获环境。状态要么放插件字段、经 `user_data` 传进去："},"1286":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调与状态","content":"订阅句柄**不会**在 drop 时自动退订——`SubscriptionHandle` 只是个 `u64`。\n要提前退订就留住它、调 `host.off(handle)`；插件卸载时宿主会整批回滚，\n但 `user_data` 指向的状态还是得自己释放。"},"1287":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"每个插件在 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下有自己的一段（见配置文件）。"},"1288":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"`plugin_start` 收到的 `config_json` **不是**这一段。那是宿主给的运行环境信息\n（`plugins_dir` / `scripts_dir` / `spawn` 等）；你自己的配置要用 `get_config(\"你的插件名\", key)` 读。"},"1289":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"| 方法                                           | 作用                                                                               |\n| -------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `get_config(section, key) -> Option<String>` | 读**任意**段。`section` 空串读顶层（`[bot]` 等），`key` 空串读整段、否则按点路径取键。返回 JSON 文本，找不到就是 `None` |","table":"table-1"},"1290":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"| 方法                                                    | 作用                                                           |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `set_config(key, value_json) -> Result<(), AbiError>` | 写**自己**的段。**没有 section 参数**——宿主按调用者身份判定，写不到别人那段。`key` 空串覆盖整段 |","table":"table-1"},"1291":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"`set_config` 回写是**全量重写** `fuyubot.toml`——手写的注释、空行会被 `toml`\n序列化丢掉。要保注释就别让插件运行时去改，把值手工维护进文件。"},"1292":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"`HostApi` 上的方法就是 VTable 的一对一封装（都替你处理了 `CString` 与线程局部缓冲）："},"1293":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                   |\n| ---- | --------------------- |\n| 打日志  | `log(LogLevel, &str)` |","table":"table-2"},"1294":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么    | 用哪个                                                                           |\n| ------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 订阅 / 退订 | `on(event, Some(filter), cb, user_data)` / `off(handle)`；过滤器是 `{\"字段路径\": 期望值}` |","table":"table-2"},"1295":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么   | 用哪个                                       |\n| ------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| 发自定义事件 | `emit(event, payload_json)`——只送自己 + 全局订阅者 |","table":"table-2"},"1296":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么       | 用哪个                                                                        |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 发 TDLib 请求 | `td_invoke_simplified(method, params_json)`；响应走 `\"response\"` 通道（见调用 TDLib） |","table":"table-2"},"1297":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么        | 用哪个                        |\n| ----------- | -------------------------- |\n| 同步执行不碰网络的方法 | `td_execute(request_json)` |","table":"table-2"},"1298":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                                                                                                      |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 工具   | `register_tool(descriptor, handler, user_data)` / `register_tool_meta` / `call_tool` / `call_tool_result` / `list_tools` |","table":"table-2"},"1299":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                                                                           |\n| ---- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 服务   | `provide_service`（自己作用域）/ `provide_service_shared`（进程级）/ `get_service` / `call_service`，见插件联动 |","table":"table-2"},"1300":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                                      |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 中间件  | `use_middleware(Stage::InPlugin, cb, user_data)`，见工具与中间件 |","table":"table-2"},"1301":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么  | 用哪个                                                                             |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 等一条更新 | `wait_for_update(filter_json, timeout_ms)`（阻塞）或 `ResponseRouter`（可 await），见异步等待 |","table":"table-2"},"1302":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                               |\n| ---- | --------------------------------- |\n| 看别人  | `list_tools()` / `list_plugins()` |","table":"table-2"},"1303":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么         | 用哪个                                                                                 |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| simplify 操作表 | `simplify_invoke(op_json)` / `simplify_invoke_result(op_json)`，见 ABI › simplify 操作表 |","table":"table-2"},"1304":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#注册一个带处理器的工具","content":"只想登记声明、不要处理器，就用 `register_tool_meta(descriptor_json)`。"},"1305":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"`define_plugin!` **一个 crate 只能展开一次**。一个 cdylib 就是一个插件——这不是限制，是设计：\n七个导出符号名由 ABI 定死，展开两次就是重复定义。"},"1306":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"要发消息、调 TDLib、等响应，见 调用 TDLib；要按字段过滤更新，见\n订阅与事件；契约本身见 ABI 契约。"},"1307":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"page","content":"Simplify 封装","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify"},"1308":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"fuyubot-simplify 的 API 参考：按功能范围分组的参数结构体、链式设置器与返回值"},"1309":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"别的语言怎么用同一套语义"},"1310":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"1. 文本内容：`Text` 与 `ParseMode`"},"1311":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#2-发送sendmessageparams","content":"2. 发送：`SendMessageParams`"},"1312":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"话题：`Topic`"},"1313":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"3. 媒体：`Media` / `InputFile` / `Thumbnail`"},"1314":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#4-相册sendalbumparams","content":"4. 相册：`SendAlbumParams`"},"1315":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"5. 编辑、删除与应答"},"1316":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#6-内联键盘replybutton","content":"6. 内联键盘：`ReplyButton`"},"1317":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#7-命令与输入","content":"7. 命令与输入"},"1318":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"8. 等待与订阅"},"1319":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#9-实体与下载","content":"9. 实体与下载"},"1320":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#10-富消息","content":"10. 富消息"},"1321":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"11. 管理权：`AdminRight`"},"1322":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#12-转发forwardparams","content":"12. 转发：`ForwardParams`"},"1323":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"13. 表情反应：`Reaction`"},"1324":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"14. 连接状态：`ConnectionTracker`"},"1325":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"15. 不挂在 `Simplify` 上的公开函数"},"1326":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"16. 参数名为什么是这几个"},"1327":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#17-异步版_then","content":"17. 异步版：`*_then`"},"1328":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#18-返回值与错误","content":"18. 返回值与错误"},"1329":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#19-简化事件","content":"19. 简化事件"},"1330":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"`fuyubot-simplify` 只做一件事：**把 TDLib 的输入拼好、把结果等回来**，返回值仍然是 TDLib 的原始 JSON\n（`Value` / `Vec<Value>`）。"},"1331":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"它是**运行时仓库里的 crate，不发 crates.io**（`publish = false`），所以只能按路径依赖："},"1332":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"写 `fuyubot-simplify = \"0.1\"` 会编不过。不想引路径依赖就用宿主暴露的 op 表\n（`simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result`，见 ABI › simplify 操作表）。"},"1333":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"三条贯穿全部方法的约定："},"1334":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"**每个方法都等到结果才返回**，不交回请求号；唯一的例外是 `formatted`（同步调用，压根没有等待）。"},"1335":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"**等待的方法是阻塞的**。插件的更新回调就跑在 TDLib 接收循环那个线程上，在那里等待=自己卡自己，\n等到的一定是超时。回调里一律用 `*_then`（见第 13 节）。"},"1336":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"失败一律是 `Err(SimplifyError)`，成功时的返回值见第 14 节。"},"1337":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"本文按**功能范围**分组；想知道这些方法内部怎么实现（为什么这么拼、为什么这么等），\n看开发 › simplify 封装是怎么实现的。"},"1338":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"**ABI v5 起这套语义不再只有 Rust 有。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑**同一份** `fuyubot-simplify` 代码\n（`fuyubot-simplify::ops`），经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张 **op 表**："},"1339":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"所以 Go / C / C++ / JS / TS / Python 插件都能用「发消息等结局、超时撤回、bot 与用户号挑不同反应\n方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树」，行为与 Rust 侧**逐字一致**——没有第二套实现。\n完整清单与结果形状见 ABI › simplify 操作表。"},"1340":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"Rust 插件**仍然用本页这些类型化方法**：它们有编译期检查与链式设置器，比拼 JSON 舒服。\n`ops` 那层是给「没有 Rust 类型系统可用」的调用方准备的。"},"1341":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"除了发/改/删，这一层还收了四件「TDLib 里没有直觉上那个方法」的事：\n管理权 / 转发 /\n表情反应 / 连接状态。"},"1342":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"带标记的文本**不由本 crate 解析**——经**同步**的 `td_execute` 问 TDLib 的 `parseTextEntities`\n（为什么不能用异步，见开发 › simplify 封装是怎么实现的里的「文本链路」一节）。"},"1343":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ text: { description: '原始文本（还没解析的那种）。', type: 'String', required: true, }, parse_mode: { descriptio…\" />"},"1344":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"快捷构造：`Text::plain` / `Text::markdown` / `Text::markdown_v2` / `Text::html` / `Text::new(text, mode)`；\n`&str` / `String` 直接转成纯文本。"},"1345":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"| `ParseMode` | 发出的 `parse_mode`                                   |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Plain`（默认） | **不发请求**，直接 `formattedText { text, entities: [] }` |","table":"table-0"},"1346":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"| `ParseMode` | 发出的 `parse_mode`                       |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `Markdown`  | `textParseModeMarkdown` + `version: 1` |","table":"table-0"},"1347":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"| `ParseMode`  | 发出的 `parse_mode`                       |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| `MarkdownV2` | `textParseModeMarkdown` + `version: 2` |","table":"table-0"},"1348":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"| `ParseMode` | 发出的 `parse_mode`    |\n| ----------- | ------------------- |\n| `Html`      | `textParseModeHTML` |","table":"table-0"},"1349":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"⚠️ **注意：MarkdownV2 的粗体是 `*x*`，不是 `**x**`。**\n`**bold**` 会被吞成 `bold` 而且**不给** bold entity，`__x__` 出来的是下划线。别按 CommonMark 的直觉写\n——这正是「不自己实现解析」的理由。"},"1350":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"拿到结果也没干活不符预期：**拿不到就退回纯文本**并打一条 `Warn` 日志（没接 TDLib、TDLib 报错都一样），\n一条 Markdown 写错的消息不该整条发不出去。"},"1351":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#2-发送sendmessageparams","content":"`simplify.send_message(chat_id, &params)` → `Result<Value>`（**最终**那条 `Message`）。"},"1352":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#2-发送sendmessageparams","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ text: { description: '文本。只填它就是纯文本消息；和 media 一起填时它是那件媒体的标题。', type: 'Option<Text>', default: 'None'…\" />"},"1353":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#2-发送sendmessageparams","content":"常用构造：`SendMessageParams::text(\"你好\")` / `SendMessageParams::media(photo)`，\n其余字段走 `..SendMessageParams::default()`。"},"1354":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"`topic_id` 不是裸 id，是 TDLib 的 `MessageTopic`——**四个构造器各有各的 id 类型**，选错了 TDLib 就拒："},"1355":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"| 构造                 | 用在哪                  | 发出的 `topic_id`                                     |\n| ------------------ | -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Topic::forum(id)` | **论坛**群组，以及与 bot 的私聊 | `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicForum\",\"forum_topic_id\":…}` |","table":"table-1"},"1356":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"| 构造                  | 用在哪           | 发出的 `topic_id`                                         |\n| ------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `Topic::thread(id)` | **非论坛**群组的评论串 | `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicThread\",\"message_thread_id\":…}` |","table":"table-1"},"1357":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"| 构造                           | 用在哪     | 发出的 `topic_id`                                                             |\n| ---------------------------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Topic::direct_messages(id)` | 频道的私信话题 | `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicDirectMessages\",\"direct_messages_chat_topic_id\":…}` |","table":"table-1"},"1358":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"| 构造                          | 用在哪   | 发出的 `topic_id`                                                      |\n| --------------------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Topic::saved_messages(id)` | 收藏夹话题 | `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicSavedMessages\",\"saved_messages_topic_id\":…}` |","table":"table-1"},"1359":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"⚠️ 刻意**没有** `From<i64>`：论坛话题是 `int32`、评论串是 `int53`，一个裸数字说不清是哪一种，\n隐式转任何一个都会在另一种群里静默发错。（这一层以前固定按 `messageTopicThread` 拼，非论坛群以外全是错的。）"},"1360":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"七个变体对应 TDLib 的七个 `inputMessage*` 构造器："},"1361":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 变体                   | 内容类型                | 能设置的字段                                                       |\n| -------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `Media::photo(file)` | `inputMessagePhoto` | `caption` / `thumbnail` / `width` / `height` / `has_spoiler` |","table":"table-2"},"1362":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 变体                   | 内容类型                | 能设置的字段                                                                         |