],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"| VTable 函数              | 输入            | 用途                                                |\n| ---------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `td_invoke_simplified` | 方法名 + 参数 JSON | 宿主把参数补上 `@type = 方法名`（参数不是对象就整份换成 `{\"@type\": …}`） |","table":"table-0"},"1543":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"| VTable 函数    | 输入                   | 用途                                                                    |\n| ------------ | -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `td_execute` | 完整请求 JSON，**同步**返回响应 | 只给「不碰服务器」的方法用（`parseTextEntities` / `getTextEntities` 之类）。当场有结果、不发请求号 |","table":"table-0"},"1544":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"前两个返回**请求号**（`RequestId`），不是结果。结果从响应通道回来。"},"1545":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"请求号把去程与回程对上"},"1546":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"插件调 td_invoke 拿到请求号，宿主注入字符串 @extra 后发给 TDLib；响应回来时接收循环按 @extra 认出归属，转成数值 request_id，再经 emit_scoped 只发回发起这个请求的插件。"},"1547":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"去程"},"1548":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"插件"},"1549":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"td_invoke → 请求号 N"},"1550":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"HostRuntime"},"1551":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"注入 @extra = \"N\""},"1552":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"TDLib"},"1553":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"真的发出去"},"1554":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"请求号"},"1555":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"响应回来"},"1556":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"回程"},"1557":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"接收循环 route()"},"1558":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"按 @extra 认出归属"},"1559":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"emit_scoped"},"1560":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"response 通道"},"1561":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"发起的插件"},"1562":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"过滤器 request_id = N"},"1563":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"同一条 @extra 把去程和回程对上；没接 TDLib 时只发合成请求号，永远等不到响应"},"1564":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"响应负载是 TDLib 原始 JSON，宿主额外挂一个**数值型** `request_id`（来自它注入的字符串 `@extra`，\n别自己设这个字段）。"},"1565":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"要等某条响应：过滤器写 `{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":5}`。`event_type` 键只选通道，\n不参与负载匹配（见 订阅与事件）。"},"1566":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"**没接 TDLib 时**（`--replay` / `--no-tdlib`）请求只留档并返回**合成请求号**（从 `1 << 48` 起），\n链路照样能测通，但永远不会真的到达 TDLib。"},"1567":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"`wait_for_update` **阻塞当前线程**，`timeout_ms == 0` 表示只检查当前状态；\n返回的 `payload_json` 是宿主线程局部缓冲，只在下一次宿主调用前有效——要留就当场拷走。"},"1568":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"⚠️ **TDLib 的方法名 ≠ Telegram Bot API 的方法名**。TDLib 里所有发送都是 `sendMessage`，\n内容类型靠 `input_message_content` 区分；`sendPhoto` / `sendDocument` / `sendLocation`\n（HTTP Bot API）**在 TDLib 里不存在**。"},"1569":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的                               | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                                                                          |\n| --------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `sendPhoto` / `sendDocument` / `sendLocation` | `sendMessage` + `input_message_content.@type` = `inputMessagePhoto` / `inputMessageDocument` / `inputMessageLocation` |","table":"table-1"},"1570":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的     | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                                                                                                                                        |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `message_thread_id` | `topic_id`，类型是 `MessageTopic`——**论坛**群组用 `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicForum\",\"forum_topic_id\":N}`，**非论坛**群组的评论串才是 `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicThread\",\"message_thread_id\":N}`（用 `Topic` 就不会选错） |","table":"table-1"},"1571":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的       | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                        |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `reply_to_message_id` | `reply_to`（`{\"@type\":\"inputMessageReplyToMessage\",\"message_id\":N}`） |","table":"table-1"},"1572":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的                               | 在 TDLib 里这么写                            |\n| --------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 顶层 `disable_notification` / `protect_content` | `options`（`@type: messageSendOptions`）里 |","table":"table-1"},"1573":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的 | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                       |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| 顶层 `caption`    | 在内容类型里（`inputMessageText` / `inputMessagePhoto` …） |","table":"table-1"},"1574":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的 | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                             |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `parse_mode`    | 没有这个字段；`formattedText` 只有 `text` + `entities`（要标记先走 `parseTextEntities`） |","table":"table-1"},"1575":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的         | 在 TDLib 里这么写         |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `file_id`（`updateFile`） | 在 **`file.id`**，不是顶层 |","table":"table-1"},"1576":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"`sendMessage` 的真签名（来自 `td_api.tl`）："},"1577":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"方法名与字段名以 `td_api.tl` 为准：在运行时仓库里搜 `sendMessage`，或者看\n`td_api.tl`。"},"1578":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#便捷封装fuyubot-simplify","content":"`Simplify` 只简化**输入**，不改变输出：每个方法都经 `td_invoke*` 发出，原始更新照旧对插件可见。\n参数形状是**一个方法一个结构体 + 短字段名**，调用方不用拼 TDLib 的嵌套 JSON；\n文本格式（Markdown / HTML）**不自己解析**，经同步的 `td_execute` 问 TDLib 的 `parseTextEntities`。"},"1579":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#便捷封装fuyubot-simplify","content":"它的**完整 API 参考（按功能范围分组）在 Simplify 封装**；\n想知道为什么这么拼、为什么这么等，看开发 › simplify 封装是怎么实现的。\n本页只留跟「请求号 + 线程」有关的那两件事——它们是这层最容易被搞错的部分。"},"1580":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"**每个方法都等到结果才返回**，不交回请求号。分两类："},"1581":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"| 类别                                               | 等到什么                                                                                                    | 返回值                                   |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 发送类（`send_message` / `send_message_album` / 富消息） | 响应（**还没发出去**的临时消息）+ 它的**发送结局**：`updateMessageSendSucceeded`（里面有最终 `Message`）或 `updateMessageSendFailed` | 最终 `Message`（相册是与 `medias` 同序的 `Vec`） |","table":"table-2"},"1582":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"| 类别                                                        | 等到什么     | 返回值                  |\n| --------------------------------------------------------- | -------- | -------------------- |\n| 其余（`edit_*` / `delete_message` / `answer_callback_query`） | 只有**响应** | 改完的 `Message` / `()` |","table":"table-2"},"1583":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"两步之间按临时消息的 `old_message_id` 精确对号，同一会话里别人的结局不会串进来；"},"1584":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"相册的 `timeout_ms` 是**整组共用**的一个预算（先等 `Messages` 响应、再等 N 条结局），不是每项各等一次；"},"1585":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"**超时先撤回**：到期还没结局，就先 `deleteMessages(revoke = true)` 把那条没发出去的消息撤掉，再返回\n`Timeout`——发出去的撤不回，没发出去的会被取消；"},"1586":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"`@type == \"error\"` 的响应一律变成 `SimplifyError::Tdlib`（例如 `Message is not modified`），\n**封装层不重试**：限流该等多久是调用方的事。"},"1587":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#回调里用-_then","content":"等更新要靠**接收循环**那个线程送回来，而插件的更新回调就跑在它上面——在那里等待=自己卡自己，\n等到的一定是超时。每个等待版都有一个 `*_then`：把等待挪到另一个线程，结局交给闭包。"},"1588":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#回调里用-_then","content":"它们返回那个线程的 `JoinHandle`——**插件要在 `stop()` 里 join 掉**，否则动态库卸载之后线程还在跑库里的代码\n（未定义行为）。三个内置插件就是这么写的，可以照抄。"},"1589":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#最小上手","content":"方法名与参数名由 `every_request_simplify_builds_passes_the_real_schema` 拿真 `td_api.tl` 烤出来的元数据\n（`TdApiSchema::compiled()`）逐条校验，离线就能跑。"},"1590":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"便捷方法把等待收进去了：发送类等**响应 + 发送结局**，其余等**响应**\n（`\"response\"` 通道，事件类型 `RESPONSE_EVENT`，只发给发起请求的那个插件）。\n想自己接原始 JSON，底层出口 `wait_response` / `wait_for_update` 仍然公开。"},"1591":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"`WaitHandle::payload_json` / `td_execute` 的返回串都是宿主临时的**线程局部缓冲**，\n只在下一次宿主调用之前有效。要拿数据就立刻读，或者用 `*_json` / `wait_response`（它们已经替你拷好了）。"},"1592":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"`HostRuntime::td_send` 在**没接 TDLib** 时只留档 + 发合成请求号（从 `1 << 48` 起），`td_execute` 在同样\n情况下返回 `None`——所以本文的每个方法在离线状态下都能被跑通、但不会真的到达 TDLib（Markdown 会退回纯文本）。"},"1593":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#python--js","content":"脚本里的 `invoke` 有第三个参数 `onResponse`（Python 是 `on_response`），响应按请求号\n自动配对，脚本不用自己记。细节在脚本板块：Python /\nJS 与 TypeScript。"},"1594":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"page","content":"调试与安装","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing"},"1595":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"回放验证、静态检查、装进插件目录"},"1596":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"静态检查导出符号"},"1597":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放：不接账号也能验插件"},"1598":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"安装"},"1599":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"装完还是不响？"},"1600":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"插件出问题通常不是「代码写得不对」，而是「没被加载」「加载了但没订阅上」「订阅了但请求拼错」。\n这三步各有对应的工具，全都不需要 Telegram 账号。"},"1601":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 做什么   | 用什么                                               | 需要账号吗 |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------- | ----- |\n| 看导出符号 | `dumpbin /exports`（Windows）/ `nm -D`（Linux/macOS） | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"1602":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 做什么     | 用什么                         | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------- | --------------------------- | ----- |\n| 跑一遍更新管线 | `fuyubot run --replay <文件>` | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"1603":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 做什么    | 用什么                           | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------ | ----------------------------- | ----- |\n| 装进插件目录 | `fuyubot plugin install <路径>` | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"1604":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 做什么     | 用什么                              | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------- | -------------------------------- | ----- |\n| 看装了哪些插件 | `fuyubot plugin list`（静态读清单，不加载） | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"1605":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 做什么     | 用什么           | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------- | ------------- | ----- |\n| 真登录、真更新 | `fuyubot run` | 是     |","table":"table-0"},"1606":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"宿主只认七个符号，缺 `plugin_init` 一定加载失败。**不要用 `dlopen` 去验**——那会在你的进程里\n跑插件的初始化代码，已经算加载了。直接读导出表："},"1607":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"应该看到 `plugin_init` / `plugin_start` / `plugin_stop` / `plugin_free_string`，\n以及可选的 `plugin_manifest` / `fuyubot_abi_version` / `plugin_free_handle`。\n看不到 `plugin_init` = 宿主一定拒绝，先查 `crate-type = [\"cdylib\"]` 和 `extern \"C\"`。"},"1608":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"三个版本别混："},"1609":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"**宿主 ABI 世代** = `HostApiVTable::version`（当前 5），就在 VTable 首字段；"},"1610":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"**插件声明的 ABI 版本** 在 `PluginHandle::abi_version`，是 `plugin_init` 的返回值——\n静态检查看不到，**装载时才判定**；"},"1611":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"**插件自己的 crate 版本** 在 `plugin_manifest` 的 `version` 字段里。"},"1612":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放把文件里的更新（单个对象或对象数组）灌进六阶段管线后退出：**不接 TDLib、不用账号**，\n插件发出的请求只留档不发。输出三样东西："},"1613":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"每条更新的 `UpdateOutcome`："},"1614":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"插件打的日志（`HostRuntime::log_lines`，上限 256 行）；"},"1615":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"插件发出去的请求：`#请求号 方法名 参数`。"},"1616":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数              | 说明             |\n| --------------- | -------------- |\n| `--replay <文件>` | 要回放的更新；对象或对象数组 |","table":"table-1"},"1617":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数                  | 说明                                         |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `--plugin-dir <目录>` | 覆盖插件目录（默认取 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `plugins.dir`） |","table":"table-1"},"1618":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数                   | 说明                                           |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `--replay-wait <MS>` | 回放后的静默窗口；不填时脚本插件 2000ms、纯原生插件 150ms（上限 60 秒） |","table":"table-1"},"1619":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"脚本插件在**另一个进程**里跑，反应要经管道回来，还可能捎带网络请求——窗口太短会把最终答复漏掉。"},"1620":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放**故意不接 TDLib**：它要在任何机器上离线可跑，接了就要账号与网络。\n所以回放能证明「插件收到更新后做出了正确判断、发出了正确请求」，**不能**证明真 Telegram 认这些参数。"},"1621":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"脚本插件走另一条路（目录形，装进 `plugins/scripts/<目录名>/`），见脚本插件。"},"1622":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"`plugin install <工程目录>` 找产物的顺序是 `<工程>/target/{release,debug}` → 工程目录本身 →\n**沿父链最近的** `target/{release,debug}`（两边都有时取**较新**的那个）。最后一档专为 workspace\n成员准备：`cargo build -p <crate>` 的产物默认落在仓库根 `target/`，工程自己那份 `target/` 并不存在，\n靠父链一样能找到——**没有 `--target-dir` 这个参数**，找不着就直接指着产物装。"},"1623":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状                   | 先看                                                              |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 导出表里没有 `plugin_init` | crate 是不是 `crate-type = [\"cdylib\"]`；C++ 的七个符号在不在 `extern \"C\"` 里 |","table":"table-2"},"1624":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                                      |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 日志里有「跳过 xxx」 | ABI 版本不匹配，或 `dlopen` 失败（缺兄弟 DLL：把依赖放在插件旁边，加载器会先查库自己的目录） |","table":"table-2"},"1625":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                                        |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 加载了但一条事件都没收到 | 订阅是不是没注册成功（`HostApi::on` 返回的句柄 `is_valid()` 为假），或事件名写成了别名 |","table":"table-2"},"1626":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状      | 先看                                                        |\n| ------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 脚本插件起不来 | 不在本板块——见脚本插件 › 排查（manifest 身份段、`run()`、`uv` / `bun`、原生桥库） |","table":"table-2"},"1627":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                                    |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| 请求发出去了但没收到响应 | 回放里本来就不会有响应（请求只留档）；真环境下等的是 `\"response\"` 通道，见 调用 TDLib |","table":"table-2"},"1628":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"TDLib 的方法名与参数名以 `td_api.tl` 为准（见调用 TDLib）；\n契约与所有权规则见 ABI 契约。"},"1629":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"page","content":"工具与中间件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools"},"1630":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools","content":"注册工具（元数据 + 处理器）、call_tool / call_tool_result、六阶段洋葱管线"},"1631":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"注册工具：元数据 + 处理器"},"1632":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"调用工具：请求号或同步结果"},"1633":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"中间件：六阶段洋葱"},"1634":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools","content":"工具（tool）是「有名字、有 schema、可被别的插件或宿主调用」的能力；中间件（middleware）\n是流经更新管线时的洋葱式拦截点。两者的注册都记在**当前插件的作用域**下：\n插件卸载（或加载失败）时宿主一次性回滚这批注册。"},"1635":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"ABI v4 的 `register_tool` 收三个东西：JSON 描述、可选的处理器、处理器要用的 `user_data`。\n处理器是 `C-unwind` 的 `fn(user_data, input_json) -> *const c_char`，返回 JSON 字符串。"},"1636":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"只登记元数据（不提供执行能力）用 `register_tool_meta(descriptor)`，等价于\n`register_tool(descriptor, None, null)`。`handle` 无效（`id == 0`）表示登记被拒\n（重名、schema 不合法等）。"},"1637":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段     | 类型     | 说明                |\n| ------ | ------ | ----------------- |\n| `name` | string | 全局唯一，建议 `插件名.工具名` |","table":"table-0"},"1638":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段        | 类型     | 说明                |\n| --------- | ------ | ----------------- |\n| `version` | string | semver，默认 `0.1.0` |","table":"table-0"},"1639":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段            | 类型     | 说明      |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------- |\n| `description` | string | 给人看的一句话 |","table":"table-0"},"1640":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段             | 类型          | 说明   |\n| -------------- | ----------- | ---- |\n| `input_schema` | JSON Schema | 描述入参 |","table":"table-0"},"1641":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段              | 类型          | 说明                  |\n| --------------- | ----------- | ------------------- |\n| `output_schema` | JSON Schema | `null` / `{}` 表示不校验 |","table":"table-0"},"1642":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段                     | 类型       | 说明        |\n| ---------------------- | -------- | --------- |\n| `required_permissions` | string[] | 调用前要过的权限门 |","table":"table-0"},"1643":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段           | 类型   | 说明         |\n| ------------ | ---- | ---------- |\n| `idempotent` | bool | 默认 `false` |","table":"table-0"},"1644":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段           | 类型     | 说明         |\n| ------------ | ------ | ---------- |\n| `timeout_ms` | number | 默认 `30000` |","table":"table-0"},"1645":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段         | 类型   | 说明         |\n| ---------- | ---- | ---------- |\n| `is_async` | bool | 默认 `false` |","table":"table-0"},"1646":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段         | 类型   | 说明                     |\n| ---------- | ---- | ---------------------- |\n| `callable` | bool | **读出时才有**：本进程里有没有可调处理器 |","table":"table-0"},"1647":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"两条入口，按需选："},"1648":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"| 入口                            | 返回          | 用途                |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------- | ----------------- |\n| `call_tool(name, input_json)` | `RequestId` | 只需要“发出去”，或将来接异步工具 |","table":"table-1"},"1649":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"| 入口                                   | 返回          | 用途                              |\n| ------------------------------------ | ----------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `call_tool_result(name, input_json)` | 结果 JSON 字符串 | **同步**拿结果（失败是 `{\"error\": \"…\"}`） |","table":"table-1"},"1650":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"`call_tool_result` 的顺序是："},"1651":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"call_tool_result 的五步链路"},"1652":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"同步调用工具时，宿主依次做：按名字查表、过权限门、校验入参 schema、跑处理器、校验出参 schema；任一步失败就返回 error 对象。"},"1653":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"同步链路：任一步不过就到此为止"},"1654":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"查表"},"1655":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"名字 → 注册项"},"1656":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"权限门"},"1657":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"required_…"},"1658":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"入参校验"},"1659":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"input_schema"},"1660":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"处理器"},"1661":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"C-unwind 回调"},"1662":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"出参校验"},"1663":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"output_schema"},"1664":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"结果 JSON（线程局部缓冲，读完即弃）"},"1665":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"任一步不过 → {'{\"error\": …}'}"},"1666":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"`call_tool`（返回请求号那条）走的是同一张表，只是不等结果——想要结果就用 `call_tool_result`。"},"1667":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"`list_tools()` 返回全部工具的元数据 JSON 数组。**宿主线程局部缓冲**：读完即弃，\n要留就当场拷走，**不要试图释放它**。"},"1668":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"脚本侧：薄 SDK 只能 `register_tool` / `registerTool` **登记元数据**，没有处理器指针——\n脚本进程不能把函数指针交回宿主，所以工具调用不会回到脚本。调用别的插件的工具、读配置、\n调服务这些也还没在薄 SDK 里暴露，见脚本插件。"},"1669":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"一个中间件自己看到的是**进入段 / 退出段**两截，中间那句 `next.run(ctx)` 就是分界："},"1670":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"中间件的洋葱：进入段、next.run、退出段"},"1671":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"一次 run 会先复制层列表再执行；next.run 之前是进入段，之后是退出段，外层先进后出。不调 next.run 就不往下走。"},"1672":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"run(stage, ctx)：层列表先复制一份再跑，所以中间件里再挂中间件不会自锁"},"1673":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"进入段"},"1674":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"next.run 之前的代码"},"1675":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"next.run(ctx)"},"1676":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"交给下一层"},"1677":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"退出段"},"1678":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"next.run 之后的代码"},"1679":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"外层先进后出；回调返回非 0 就中断这一阶段；不调 next.run 就是不往下走"},"1680":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段          | 数值  | 谁跑它       |\n| ----------- | --- | --------- |\n| `PreUpdate` | 0   | 收到更新、还没解析 |","table":"table-2"},"1681":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段         | 数值  | 谁跑它             |\n| ---------- | --- | --------------- |\n| `PreRoute` | 1   | 已解析 `@type`，路由前 |","table":"table-2"},"1682":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段         | 数值  | 谁跑它                   |\n| ---------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `InPlugin` | 2   | 分发给监听器之前；**一条更新只跑一遍** |","table":"table-2"},"1683":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段             | 数值  | 谁跑它    |\n| -------------- | --- | ------ |\n| `PostResponse` | 3   | 响应发出之后 |","table":"table-2"},"1684":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段            | 数值  | 谁跑它                   |\n| ------------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `PreToolCall` | 4   | 工具调用之前（**目前没有生产调用方**） |","table":"table-2"},"1685":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段             | 数值  | 谁跑它        |\n| -------------- | --- | ---------- |\n| `PostToolCall` | 5   | 工具调用之后（同上） |","table":"table-2"},"1686":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"数值就是 ABI 里的 `stage` 参数，与 `fuyubot-middleware::Stage` 一一对应。"},"1687":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"要点："},"1688":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"**回调是 `C-unwind` 的** `fn(user_data, stage: u32, payload_json) -> i32`：返回 `0` 继续、**非 0 中断本阶段**。\n中断只影响**本阶段剩下的层**，管线继续走下一阶段（已经改过的负载照样往下传），宿主记一条 warning。"},"1689":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"**中间件一条更新跑一遍，不是每个监听器跑一遍**：`InPlugin` 的产出就是所有监听器看到的版本。\n按监听器各跑一遍的话，第 N 个会看到被改过 N 次的负载。"},"1690":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"洋葱模型：进入段在「继续往下」之前，退出段在之后。不往下走就是中断。"},"1691":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"Rust 侧 `MiddlewareHandle` 只是一个 `u64`，drop 不会摘除；注册后一直有效到插件卸载。"},"1692":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"阶段号非法或回调为空会让 `use_middleware` 直接返回无效句柄（不会静默挂个空层）。"},"1693":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"想看订阅与双通道怎么配合，见 订阅与事件；工具调用的格式最终由宿主层决定，\n契约本身见 ABI 契约。"},"1694":{"id":"/docs/script","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"page","content":"脚本插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","脚本插件"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/script"},"1695":{"id":"/docs/script-0","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"Python / JS / TS 写逻辑：由独立的 fuyubot.script 插件托管，不编译、装上就跑"},"1696":{"id":"/docs/script-1","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#它是怎么搭起来的","content":"它是怎么搭起来的"},"1697":{"id":"/docs/script-2","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"装宿主插件"},"1698":{"id":"/docs/script-3","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#前置条件","content":"前置条件"},"1699":{"id":"/docs/script-4","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"写第一个脚本"},"1700":{"id":"/docs/script-5","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#装进机器人","content":"装进机器人"},"1701":{"id":"/docs/script-6","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"装好之后会发生什么"},"1702":{"id":"/docs/script-7","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#脚本目录在哪","content":"脚本目录在哪"},"1703":{"id":"/docs/script-8","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"排查"},"1704":{"id":"/docs/script-9","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"**运行时不认识 Python，也不认识 JavaScript。** 脚本能力**完全由另一个插件提供**：\nFuyuBot-Script 打出的 `fuyubot.script`。\n它本身就是一个普通的 ABI 插件——装进 `plugins/` 之后，替宿主去扫 `plugins/scripts/`、\n给每个脚本起一个子进程、把事件和请求来回搬。"},"1705":{"id":"/docs/script-10","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"所以这一块和「插件开发」是两件事："},"1706":{"id":"/docs/script-11","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"|       | 原生插件（插件开发） | 脚本插件（本板块）               |\n| ----- | ---------- | ----------------------- |\n| 谁提供能力 | 运行时本体      | 独立的 `fuyubot.script` 插件 |","table":"table-0"},"1707":{"id":"/docs/script-12","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"|      | 原生插件（插件开发）                     | 脚本插件（本板块）             |\n| ---- | ------------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| 你写什么 | Rust / C / C++ / Go，编译成 cdylib | Python / JS / TS，一个目录 |","table":"table-0"},"1708":{"id":"/docs/script-13","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"|      | 原生插件（插件开发） | 脚本插件（本板块） |\n| ---- | ---------- | --------- |\n| 要编译吗 | 要          | 不要        |","table":"table-0"},"1709":{"id":"/docs/script-14","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"|     | 原生插件（插件开发）   | 脚本插件（本板块）    |\n| --- | ------------ | ------------ |\n| 边界  | 与宿主同进程，C ABI | 一个脚本一个解释器子进程 |","table":"table-0"},"1710":{"id":"/docs/script-15","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"|       | 原生插件（插件开发） | 脚本插件（本板块）       |\n| ----- | ---------- | --------------- |\n| 崩了会怎样 | 可能拖垮宿主     | 只有那个子进程死，宿主记一条错 |","table":"table-0"},"1711":{"id":"/docs/script-16","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#它是怎么搭起来的","content":"一个中间插件、两个语言运行时、N 个脚本进程："},"1712":{"id":"/docs/script-17","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#它是怎么搭起来的","content":"**一个脚本一个进程**：脚本崩溃、死循环、内存涨爆，都只影响它自己。"},"1713":{"id":"/docs/script-18","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#它是怎么搭起来的","content":"**stdio 协议**：脚本的 stdout / stdin 上跑「一行一个 JSON」。薄 SDK 把它包成函数调用，\n作者看不到任何 `op` / `tag` / `handle`。"},"1714":{"id":"/docs/script-19","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#它是怎么搭起来的","content":"**子作用域**：每个脚本的订阅、工具、中间件都落在自己的作用域里，停掉它只撤它自己的注册。"},"1715":{"id":"/docs/script-20","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"去 FuyuBot-Script Releases\n下载对应平台的 `fuyubot-script-<OS>-<平台>.zip`（例：`fuyubot-script-windows-x86_64.zip`）。"},"1716":{"id":"/docs/script-21","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"解压，把里面的 `plugins/fuyubot.script/` **整个目录**放进机器人的 `plugins/`。"},"1717":{"id":"/docs/script-22","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"重启 `fuyubot`。"},"1718":{"id":"/docs/script-23","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"`fuyubot plugin list` 的「原生插件包」那一段里能看到 `fuyubot.script`；\n「脚本插件」那一段列出 `plugins/scripts/` 里已经装好的脚本。"},"1719":{"id":"/docs/script-24","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"运行时发行包里**不带**脚本能力：内置插件只有 `/start`、`/help`、`/plugins` 那几个。\n脚本插件单独发版、单独升级，装与不装都不影响运行时本体。"},"1720":{"id":"/docs/script-25","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#前置条件","content":"| 语言     | 要装  | 谁在用                                |\n| ------ | --- | ---------------------------------- |\n| Python | uv  | `uv sync` 装依赖，`uv run <entry>` 起脚本 |","table":"table-1"},"1721":{"id":"/docs/script-26","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#前置条件","content":"| 语言      | 要装           | 谁在用                                 |\n| ------- | ------------ | ----------------------------------- |\n| JS / TS | bun（≥ 1.3.1） | `bun install` 装依赖，`bun <entry>` 起脚本 |","table":"table-1"},"1722":{"id":"/docs/script-27","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#前置条件","content":"只缺其中一门，只会让那门语言的脚本起不来；机器人本体照常跑，日志里会有提示。"},"1723":{"id":"/docs/script-28","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"一个目录就是一个插件，身份写在 manifest 里。Python 用 `pyproject.toml`："},"1724":{"id":"/docs/script-29","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"JS / TS 用 `package.json`："},"1725":{"id":"/docs/script-30","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"入口文件只用薄 SDK，不需要任何构建步骤："},"1726":{"id":"/docs/script-31","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"按语言看完整方法表与示例："},"1727":{"id":"/docs/script-32","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"<Card title=\"Python 插件\" href=\"/docs/script/python/\" />"},"1728":{"id":"/docs/script-33","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"<Card title=\"JS 与 TypeScript 插件\" href=\"/docs/script/js-ts/\" />"},"1729":{"id":"/docs/script-34","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装进机器人","content":"整个目录被复制到 `plugins/scripts/<目录名>/`。目录名是装卸载的单位，\nmanifest 里的 `name` 是插件身份——两者不必相同（卸载时用目录名）。"},"1730":{"id":"/docs/script-35","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装进机器人","content":"要把它打成可分发的 zip（带 `plugin.json`、`kind` 写 `python` / `js`），见\n插件分发格式 v1。"},"1731":{"id":"/docs/script-36","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                           | 机器人的反应                                        |\n| ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin install <目录>` | 整个目录拷进 `plugins/scripts/<目录名>/`，下次 `run` 自动加载 |","table":"table-2"},"1732":{"id":"/docs/script-37","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                            | 机器人的反应                                               |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 运行中往 `plugins/scripts/` 丢一个新目录 | 约一秒内发现 → `uv sync` / `bun install` → 起进程 → 等 `ready` |","table":"table-2"},"1733":{"id":"/docs/script-38","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的         | 机器人的反应                    |\n| ----------- | ------------------------- |\n| 运行中删掉一个脚本目录 | 杀掉对应子进程并撤掉它的注册（跑着的实例上也安全） |","table":"table-2"},"1734":{"id":"/docs/script-39","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的      | 机器人的反应              |\n| -------- | ------------------- |\n| 改了脚本里的代码 | **不**自动重启；改完重启机器人即可 |","table":"table-2"},"1735":{"id":"/docs/script-40","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                              | 机器人的反应    |\n| -------------------------------- | --------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin uninstall <目录名>` | 删掉目录并停掉脚本 |","table":"table-2"},"1736":{"id":"/docs/script-41","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"两个数量级上的细节："},"1737":{"id":"/docs/script-42","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"**启动有 10 秒预算**：`plugin_start` 最多等每个脚本 10 秒报 `ready`，超时算这个脚本失败。\n第一次 `uv sync` / `bun install` 可能更久——先手动装一遍依赖再启动会快很多。"},"1738":{"id":"/docs/script-43","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"**只认目录增删，不做热更新**：watch 只比较「顶层有哪些脚本目录」，\n所以 `node_modules` / `.venv` 里的文件风暴不会触发任何动作，代价是改代码必须重启。"},"1739":{"id":"/docs/script-44","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"脚本身份必须能被静态读到：Python 的 `[tool.fuyubot]`、JS 的 `\"fuyubot\"` 段。\n两样都没有的目录不是插件，`plugin list` 不会列它，`run` 也不会跑它。"},"1740":{"id":"/docs/script-45","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#脚本目录在哪","content":"固定是**插件目录下的 `scripts/`**（默认 `plugins/scripts/`），没有配置项可以改。\n想换地方就整体换插件目录（`fuyubot run --plugin-dir …` 或 `[plugins].dir`）。"},"1741":{"id":"/docs/script-46","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"**`plugin list` 里没有某个脚本**：目录里没有身份段，或者入口文件不在，\n或者它在 `.disabled/` 里。"},"1742":{"id":"/docs/script-47","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"**脚本起不来**：先看日志里那条 `ready` 超时/退出码；常见原因是 `uv` / `bun` 没装、\n依赖装不上、入口文件路径写错。"},"1743":{"id":"/docs/script-48","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"**「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」**：薄 SDK 要加载 `fuyubot_script` 那份 dll。\n宿主起脚本时会自动设 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` 指过去，所以**别把 dll 挪出\n`plugins/fuyubot.script/`**；实在要挪就自己设这个变量。"},"1744":{"id":"/docs/script-49","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"**改了代码没反应**：不热重载，重启机器人。"},"1745":{"id":"/docs/script-50","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"**想看得更细**：把 `[plugins].log_level` 调成 `\"debug\"`，脚本的 `log()` 会原样转发到宿主日志。"},"1746":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"page","content":"JS 与 TypeScript 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","脚本插件"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts"},"1747":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-0","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts","content":"bun 上的薄 SDK：方法表、事件过滤、`_` 写 @type，以及异步写法"},"1748":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-1","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"方法一览"},"1749":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-2","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#事件","content":"事件"},"1750":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-3","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#写-tdlib-参数_-就是-type","content":"写 TDLib 参数：`_` 就是 `@type`"},"1751":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-4","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#调-tdlib","content":"调 TDLib"},"1752":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-5","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#异步runasync--invokeasync--waitasync","content":"异步：`runAsync` / `invokeAsync` / `waitAsync`"},"1753":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-6","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#日志工具与中间件","content":"日志、工具与中间件"},"1754":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-7","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#完整示例","content":"完整示例"},"1755":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-8","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#现在还没有的能力","content":"现在还没有的能力"},"1756":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-9","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"1757":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-10","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts","content":"JS / TS 脚本插件同样是一个目录：`package.json` 写身份，`index.ts` 写逻辑，\n`fuyubot` 是从 npm 装的薄 SDK。宿主插件与安装流程见 脚本插件。"},"1758":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-11","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts","content":"要求 **bun ≥ 1.3.1**（SDK 用的是 `bun:ffi`，旧版本的 `cstring` 参数行为不一样）。\nTS 不需要额外配置，bun 直接跑 `.ts`。"},"1759":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-12","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                            | 干什么                     |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `on(event, handler, filter?)` | 订阅一条事件；返回回调对象，可交给 `off` |","table":"table-0"},"1760":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-13","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法              | 干什么             |\n| --------------- | --------------- |\n| `off(callback)` | 退订 `on` 返回的那个对象 |","table":"table-0"},"1761":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-14","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                     | 干什么                     |\n| -------------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `invoke(method, params?, onResponse?)` | 发一条 TDLib 请求；给了回调就按请求配对 |","table":"table-0"},"1762":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-15","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                             | 干什么                                    |\n| ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| `invokeAsync(method, params?)` | `invoke` 的 Promise 版，只能在 `runAsync` 里用 |","table":"table-0"},"1763":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-16","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                               | 干什么                     |\n| -------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `waitAsync(filter?, timeoutMs?)` | 等一条匹配的更新；超时/取消返回 `null` |","table":"table-0"},"1764":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-17","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                      | 干什么                     |\n| ----------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `emit(event, payload?)` | 发一条自定义事件（自己 + 全局订阅者收得到） |","table":"table-0"},"1765":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-18","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                     | 干什么                                                     |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `log(message, level?)` | 打日志；level：`error` / `warn` / `info` / `debug` / `trace` |","table":"table-0"},"1766":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-19","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                               | 干什么                  |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | -------------------- |\n| `registerTool(name, description?, inputSchema?)` | 登记工具的**元数据**（没有执行回调） |","table":"table-0"},"1767":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-20","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                              | 干什么                                           |\n| ------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `useMiddleware(stage, handler)` | 挂中间件，`handler(stage, payload)`，`stage` 是 0..5 |","table":"table-0"},"1768":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-21","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法      | 干什么                            |\n| ------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `run()` | 发 `ready` 握手，然后阻塞收事件——**最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"1769":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-22","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                | 干什么                                |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `runAsync(main?)` | Promise 版：原生桥在后台读 stdin，JS 事件循环继续跑 |","table":"table-0"},"1770":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-23","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"和 Python 一样的两条：**不是装饰器**（`on` 是个普通函数）、**`run()` / `runAsync()`\n都阻塞到进程结束**，写在文件最后。"},"1771":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-24","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#事件","content":"事件名就是 TDLib 更新的 `@type`，另外每条更新还会落到兜底的 `\"update\"` 通道。\n自己 `emit()` 的事件只送自己 + 全局订阅者。"},"1772":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-25","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#事件","content":"过滤器是「点分路径 = 期望值」，所有条件都相等才触发："},"1773":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-26","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#写-tdlib-参数_-就是-type","content":"TDLib 的每个对象都要带判别字段 `@type`，写起来啰嗦。JS / TS 的 SDK 允许你写 `_`，\n发送前会**递归**换成 `@type`（`vector<T>` 里的对象也一样）；两个都写时以 `@type` 为准。"},"1774":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-27","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#写-tdlib-参数_-就是-type","content":"这层规整只在 JS / TS 侧有，Python 侧要老老实实写 `\"@type\"`。"},"1775":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-28","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#调-tdlib","content":"`invoke` 不阻塞、立刻返回；请求号由 SDK 配对。方法名与字段以 TDLib 为准（不是 Bot API），\n发送一律是 `sendMessage` + `input_message_content`。"},"1776":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-29","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#异步runasync--invokeasync--waitasync","content":"`runAsync` 在后台线程读 stdin，但**回调在主线程的 `step()` 循环里分发**\n（bun 的 JSCallback 不能跨线程调）；`main` 与 step 循环并行跑，直到宿主关掉管道。"},"1777":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-30","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#异步runasync--invokeasync--waitasync","content":"`invokeAsync` 的 **TDLib 业务错误也会 resolve**（返回 `@type: \"error\"` 的对象），\n只有宿主拒绝请求才 reject。"},"1778":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-31","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#异步runasync--invokeasync--waitasync","content":"`waitAsync` 是一次性订阅：命中或超时后自动退订；`timeoutMs=0` 表示一直等。"},"1779":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-32","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#异步runasync--invokeasync--waitasync","content":"不用 `main` 也行：`await runAsync()` 只跑事件循环，`on` 回调里自己起异步任务。"},"1780":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-33","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#日志工具与中间件","content":"中间件的六阶段与原生插件一致，见 工具与中间件。"},"1781":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-34","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**回声机器人**："},"1782":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-35","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**命令处理器**："},"1783":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-36","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#现在还没有的能力","content":"薄 SDK 只覆盖「收事件、发请求、打日志、登记工具、挂中间件」。下面这些宿主的 ABI\n有、但 JS / TS 侧**还没暴露**："},"1784":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-37","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#现在还没有的能力","content":"读写 `[plugin.<名字>]` 配置段"},"1785":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-38","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#现在还没有的能力","content":"调用其它插件注册的工具 / 共享服务"},"1786":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-39","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#现在还没有的能力","content":"`simplify` 操作表（发消息等结局、Markdown → entities 之类）"},"1787":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-40","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#现在还没有的能力","content":"原生插件不受这个限制，见 插件 ABI。"},"1788":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-41","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**`Cannot find package 'fuyubot'`**：依赖没装进脚本目录。`bun add fuyubot`，\n再重启机器人（或先手动 `bun install`）。"},"1789":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-42","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**`bun:ffi` 报错 / 回调收不到**：先确认 bun ≥ 1.3.1；再确认 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB`\n指到了 `plugins/fuyubot.script/` 里的那份 dll（宿主起脚本时会自动设）。"},"1790":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-43","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**自检**：`bun node_modules/fuyubot/fuyubot.ts` 只验证 API 形状、不碰宿主，\n输出 `fuyubot: self-test ok`；它仍要能加载原生桥（宿主起脚本时会设 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB`，\n手动跑就自己指到 `fuyubot_script` 那份 dll）。"},"1791":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-44","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**类型**：`fuyubot` 自带 `fuyubot.d.ts`，不需要手写声明；TDLib 负载是 `any`，\n`update.message` 之类记得判空。"},"1792":{"id":"/docs/script/python","page_id":"/docs/script/python","type":"page","content":"Python 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","脚本插件"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/python"},"1793":{"id":"/docs/script/python-0","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python","content":"薄 SDK 的方法表、事件与过滤、异步等待，以及能直接抄的例子"},"1794":{"id":"/docs/script/python-1","page_id":"/docs/script/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"方法一览"},"1795":{"id":"/docs/script/python-2","page_id":"/docs/script/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/python#事件","content":"事件"},"1796":{"id":"/docs/script/python-3","page_id":"/docs/script/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/python#调-tdlib","content":"调 TDLib"},"1797":{"id":"/docs/script/python-4","page_id":"/docs/script/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/python#异步run_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"异步：`run_async` / `invoke_async` / `wait_async`"},"1798":{"id":"/docs/script/python-5","page_id":"/docs/script/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/python#日志工具与中间件","content":"日志、工具与中间件"},"1799":{"id":"/docs/script/python-6","page_id":"/docs/script/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/python#完整示例","content":"完整示例"},"1800"